DESCRIPTION:The <a href="http://monthlymoviechallenge.com"><b>Instant Grati
 fication Movie Challenge</b></a>&nbsp\;is a monthly movie making exercise w
 ith a theme. Anyone and everyone is welcome to make movie based on the curr
 ent theme.&nbsp\;<br><br>For our first theme of 2018\, we are partnering wi
 th the Burroughs Century and Wounded Galaxies to bring a <b>"Burroughsian"<
 /b> theme to the movie challenge.&nbsp\;<br><br>For some or our regulars\, 
 this may seem pretty specific\, but remember films can be as loose or as st
 rict to the theme. So they can have a very clear influence by the works of 
 William S. Burroughs\, or you can find inspiration from some of the quotes 
 below\, or from anything you may have heard\, thought\, or read about Burro
 ughs.&nbsp\;<br><br>If you are submitting a film\, you may contact us at mo
 nthlymoviechallenge@gmail.com<br>You can also just bring your finished film
  on a flash drive to the screening.<br>Films should be 5 minutes or LESS\, 
 longer is fine too\, but not too much longer.&nbsp\;<br><br>Free. 7:pm<br><
 a href="https://www.facebook.com/blockhousebar/">https://www.facebook.com/b
 lockhousebar/</a><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/events/1369059369976
 28/">FB EVENT</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20180105T164131Z
LOCATION:The Blockhouse Bar
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Instant Gratification Movie Challenge "Burroughsian"
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
