BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Let's Go! Bloomington
DTSTART:20180210T203000Z
DTEND:20180210T220000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041548Z
UID:0iad1p340f2g81mm2f3q9nau5a@google.com
CREATED:20180105T165011Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us in the Monroe County Public Library auditorium as we we
 lcome Ignatz Award winning cartoonist\, illustrator\, and comic publisher <
 b>Box Brown</b> (<i>Tetris\, Andre The Giant\, Retrofit</i>)! Hear Box talk
  about his new graphic novel Is <b><i>This Guy For Real: The Unbelievable A
 ndy Kaufman</i></b> and answer your questions! Vintage Phoenix Comic Books 
 will be on hand with copies of the book\, which you can have signed by the 
 author!&nbsp\;<br><br>"Comedian and performer Andy Kaufman’s resume was imp
 ressive - a popular role on the beloved sitcom Taxi\, a high-profile stand-
 up career\, and a surprisingly successful stint in professional wrestling. 
 Although he was by all accounts a sensitive and thoughtful person\, he’s ir
 onically best remembered for his various contemptible personas\, which were
  so committed and so convincing that all but his closest family and friends
  were completely taken in. Why would someone so gentle-natured and sensitiv
 e build an entire career seeking the hatred of his audience? What drives a 
 performer to solicit that reaction? With the same nuance and sympathy with 
 which he approached Andre the Giant in his 2014 biography\, graphic novelis
 t Box Brown takes on the complex and often hilarious life of Andy Kaufman."
 <br><br><br>FREE!<br><a href="https://mcpl.evanced.info/signup/EventDetails
 ?EventId=58689&amp\;backTo=Calendar&amp\;startDate=2018/02/01">Library Page
 </a><br><br><a href="http://boxbrown.com/">http://boxbrown.com/</a><br><br>
 <a href="https://www.facebook.com/events/131532050860317/">FB EVENT</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20180105T165011Z
LOCATION:Monroe County Public Library
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Box Brown Author Talk and Signing
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
