DESCRIPTION:From FB<br><br><i>Comedian and three time Moth story slam winne
 r makes his way to Bloomington\, IN on September 19th at the best pizza pla
 ce in the state King Dough!</i><br><i><b><br></b></i><br><i><b>John Dick Wi
 nters</b> is a stand up comedian\, comedy producer and storyteller based in
  Pittsburgh but has performed as far away as just outside of Pittsburgh. He
  is the founder of Race to the Coffin Comedy and the Burning Bridges Festiv
 al\, the largest comedy fest in Pennsylvania. Probably. Who knows to be hon
 est? Prove him wrong.</i><br><i><br></i><br><i>Touring the country on the n
 ational independent comedy circuit for nearly a half decade John has worked
  with countless of incredibly talented comics that no one has ever heard of
  and a few whose name’s you may actually recognize such as: Aparna Nancherl
 a\, Brian Posehn\, James Adomian\, Sean Patton\, Ron Funches\, Kyle Kinane\
 , Myq Kaplan\, Sara Schaefer\, Rory Scovel\, Geoff Tate\, Kyle Dunnigan\, S
 hane Torres\, Graig Gass\, Steve Byrne and the late Ralphie May.</i><br><i>
 <br></i><br><i>JDW is a three time Moth soryslam winner including one Grand
 SLAM victory\, he won the innagural Acrcade Comedy Theater Contest in 2014 
 and placed 3rd in the Funniest Comic in Pittsburgh contest in 2015\, has hi
 s own segment on the WDVE Morning Show w/ Randy Baumann and has been part o
 f many comedy festivals such as\; The Cleveland Comedy Fest(14\,15)\, The P
 ittsburgh Comedy Fest(14\,15)\, The Accidental Comedy Fest(14\,16)\, The Ca
 pe Fear Comedy Fest(14\,15)\, the Scruffy City Comedy Fest(14)\, The DVE Co
 medy Fest(15\,16\,17) and was just recently accepted to the Memphis Comedy 
 Fest(18). In Novemeber of 2016\, three days after trump was elected\, John 
 recorded his first hour long comedy special ironically titled “Celebrate th
 e Ugly Things”. It streams for free on YouTube.</i><br><i><br></i><br><i>Hi
 s style is part observational\, part autobiographical\, part mumble. Heavil
 y tattooed\, always in black\, standing over 6ft tall\, John looks intimida
 ting but his comedy is anything but. John Dick Winters will play your bar\,
  your living room\, your black box theater\, your garage\, your comedy club
  and whoever is in attendance will leave smiling.&nbsp\;</i><br><i><br></i>
 <br><i><a href="https://www.johndickwinters.com/">https://www.johndickwinte
 rs.com/</a></i><br><i><br></i><br><i><b>Mo Mitchell </b>started her stand u
 p comedy journey fresh out of high school at the tender age of 18. Now at a
  weathered 22\, she continues that journey. She's a 3 time member of the il
 lustrious Blooming10 in the Limestone Comedy Festival\, a regular performer
  at the world renown Comedy Attic\, and has only cried on stage once in fou
 r years. She needs this more than you do.</i><br><i><br></i><br><i><b>Krist
 en Lucas</b> (who didn't write this bio) is a stand up comedian out of Bloo
 mington\, IN. Kristen is a unique comedic voice who's observations on herse
 lf and the world entertain audiences all over the midwest. She has performe
 d multiple times at the Limestone Comedy Festival and was the winner of the
  2016 Funniest Person in Bloomington competition.</i><br><i><br></i><br><i>
 Host - <b>Mark Bookwalter</b></i><br><i>Mark Bookwalter is a fast-rising ta
 lent in the Midwest comedy scene. Mark learned at an early age to use sarca
 sm and a sharp wit to combat being an overweight nerdy kid with bullies and
  low self-esteem. Now an aging Gen-X’er and father of two he uses those ski
 lls to entertain audiences across the country. Mark performs regularly at T
 he Comedy Attic in Bloomington\, IN and has been selected to perform at suc
 h festivals as the Charm City Comedy Festival\, the Limestone Comedy Festiv
 al\, Let’s Fest\, and was a semifinalist in the Bloomington Comedy Festival
 ."</i><br><i>8:pm</i><br><i><a href="goog_288588560"><br></a></i><br><a hre
 f="https://www.facebook.com/events/693278647684812/">FB EVENT</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20180819T201519Z
LOCATION:King Dough
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
