 o\nhttp://bit.ly/2xb7Gsi\n\nFrom FB:\n\nWe're putting together a SPECIAL NI
 GHT of atmospheric music and experimental art! We'll have a loop of silent 
 films and other experimental art around the space and will have the bar/sna
 ck lounge open as well. Between sets\, Rest You Sleeping Giant will serenad
 e the space with solo shoegaze!\n\nWildCare Inc. is a Bloomington-based non
 -profit that provides professional care to sick\, injured\, and orphaned wi
 ldlife\, always with the goal of releasing them back to the wild. Wildcare 
 also maintains education outreach programs focusing on the value of sharing
  the planet with our wild neighbors. It is powered almost exclusively by do
 zens of volunteers and individual donors. They rehabilitate hundreds of ani
 mals every year\, from songbirds to hawks\, turtles to bats\, and bunnies t
 o bobcats. Learn more at http://wildcareinc.org/\n\nhttps://www.facebook.co
 m/events/1421697094586853/
