DESCRIPTION:Live Mershon Art Opening. \nhttp://callheroliver.wixsite.com/ma
 mmysmammifesto\n\n"You know that feeling of forgetting the face of an old l
 over and when you try to recall it?  Or when you look at your dog and see y
 our own face too?  When you gaze in a mirror in a dream\, what face do you 
 see?  How long before it shifts?  These are the spirits Liv Mershon attempt
 s to capture in her new body of work\, Unread Message. Called up from an em
 pty space\, these automatic drawings and portraits attempt to take the view
 er to a place where less is said the moment words pass our lips"
LAST-MODIFIED:20190224T155353Z
LOCATION:Rainbow Bakery
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Live Mershon Art Opening
TRANSP:OPAQUE
