DESCRIPTION:"Join us in the Monroe County Public Library (Indiana) auditori
 um for the Indiana debut of A Life in Waves\, the new documentary about bel
 oved synthesizer pioneer (and native Hoosier!) Suzanne Ciani!\n\n "A Life i
 n Waves explores the life and innovations of composer and electronic music 
 pioneer\, Suzanne Ciani. From her earliest days learning the piano\, to her
  multi-million dollar advertising ventures\, to her successes in the world 
 of New Age music\, to her recent re-connection with her beloved Buchla synt
 hesizer\, the film is a journey into Suzanne's mind\, offering a feminine g
 limpse into the often complicated world of electronic music."\n\n Immediate
 ly following the screening\, Suzanne will join us via video from her home i
 n California for a live q&a with you\, the audience!"\n\nhttps://www.youtub
 e.com/watch?v=puLTePqBlQI\nhttp://www.alifeinwaves.com/
LAST-MODIFIED:20171124T120530Z
LOCATION:Monroe County Public Library
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Screening: A Life in Waves (2017)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
