 p to table: <a href="https://bloomingtonzinefest.wordpress.com/">https://bl
 oomingtonzinefest.wordpress.com/ </a>Tabling registration closes September 
 30.<br><br>Email us at bloomingtonzinefest@protonmail.com if you'd like to 
 host a workshop on DIY or zine culture. We'd love to have you."<br><a href=
 "goog_288588565"><br></a><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/events/71653
