BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Let's Go! Bloomington
DTSTART:20180328T130000Z
DTEND:20180328T140000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041548Z
UID:0rhu28ugrp2c08telt4sqghoru@google.com
CREATED:20180315T105525Z
DESCRIPTION:<div class="js-xd-read-more-toggle-view read-more__toggle-view"
 ><div class="js-xd-read-more-contents l-mar-top-3" data-automation="listing
 -event-description"><p><span>Training Overview: This half-day training will
  allow participants to define and recognize the origins of gender based vio
 lence and its relationship to trauma. It will also introduce the concept of
  gender based violence and how it has an impact on the health and well-bein
 g of its survivors. The training will explore how gender based oppression i
 s a form of trauma and its intersection with other forms of oppression such
  as gender identity/expression\, race\, class and sexual orientation. Final
 ly\, we will discuss how applying a harm reduction and trauma informed fram
 ework to our work with gender based violence can support survivor’s empower
 ment and self-efficacy. </span><br><span>Training Objectives: By the end of
  the training\, participants will be able to: </span><br><span>• Recall the
  meaning of gender based violence\, trauma and harm reduction\; </span><br>
 <span>• Identify three ways in which gender based violence survivors experi
 ence trauma and marginalization\; </span><br><span>• Identify two consequen
 ces of gender based violence on access to services\; </span><br><span>• Rec
 ognize the interconnections of trauma informed services and harm reduction 
 principles </span><br><span>• Identify conceptual and practical tools (best
  practices) to support survivors of gender based violence in their empowerm
 ent and healing process\, as well as how to practice self-care as providers
 .</span></p><p><span>Presented by the <b>Indiana Recovery Alliance</b>. <br
 ><a href="http://indianarecoveryalliance.org/">http://indianarecoveryallian
 ce.org/</a></span></p><p><span><a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/gender
 -based-violence-trauma-informed-care-and-harm-reduction-tickets-43767979204
 ">Event Brite site.</a><br></span></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20180315T105525Z
LOCATION:Monroe County Public Library
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Workshop: Gender Based Violence\, Trauma Informed Care & Harm Reduc
 tion
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
