DESCRIPTION:Karima Walker (Tucson\, AZ) \nhttps://orindalrecords.bandcamp.c
 om/album/hands-in-our-names\nKarima makes spare and atmospheric folk songs 
 that are gorgeous and haunting. Half discernable song\, half tape loop myst
 ery. Really beautiful stuff\, She'll be here with her new record\, "Hands i
 n Our Names"\, on Orindal Records!\n\nGoodhands Team (Bloomington\, IN) \nh
 ttps://redfrostindustries.bandcamp.com/album/austerity-measures\nGoodhands 
 Team is Josh Olivo's electronic/ambient project that I just love to death. 
 Their record "Austerity Measures" is a favorite of mine\, THEN I saw them l
 ive at the Artifex Guild and it blew my mind off. I'm excited to see what's
  cooking at this show.\n\nGolden Braid (Bloomington\, IN)\nhttps://bluesanc
 t.bandcamp.com/album/golden-braid\nMike Adams and old pal Jared Cheek doing
  a live "version" of the new Golden Braid collaborative LP that's out now o
 n Bluesanct.\n\nhttp://thevoidbloomington.tumblr.com/
