UID:2lcmfdrcer6t8g7d0h7h4q5h0h@google.com
CREATED:20181104T025406Z
DESCRIPTION:\nFrom FB:\nDouble Blind (No Sex Last Night) (1996) Directed by
  Sophie Calle and Greg Shephard: \nA generic fusion of the essayistic docum
 entary and the road movie\, inspired by the work of Chris Marker\,Double Bl
 ind (No Sex Last Night) (1996) is an amalgamation of two synchronously reco
 rded video diaries which document French conceptual artist Sophie Calle and
  American photographer Gregory Shephard’s journey by Cadillac across the Un
 ited States. Exploring the concurrence of intimacy and alienation across su
 bjective\, cultural\, and gendered lines\, Double Blind is a blithely comed
 ic and uncanny illustration of the gulfs that persist and\, in some ways\, 
 define the dynamics of idyllic romance and the co-experience of companionsh
 ip. \n\n(Dir. Sophie Calle\, Greg Shephard\, 1996\, 76 mins\, DVD)\n\nThe S
 creening Room temperature tends to run cool\, so please remember to bring a
  jacket or sweater.\n\n\nNo food or drink is permitted in the Screening Roo
 m.\n\nFree but ticketed.\n1320 E 10th St\, Bloomington\, Indiana 47405
LAST-MODIFIED:20181104T025406Z
LOCATION:Indiana University Libraries Moving Image Archive
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Screening - Double Blind (No Sex Last Night) (1996)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
