DESCRIPTION:\nAll Ages. All Welcome\n\nBloomington Anarchist Black Cross pr
 esents a documentary film on the anarchist revolution in Spain\, told throu
 gh interviews with those who participated in the uprising\, subsequent expe
 rimentations with freedom\, and war against the forces of the State\, Churc
 h\, and Capital. The film explores the attempts at self-management leading 
 up to the popular rebellion of 1936\, the place of anti-authoritarian milit
 ias in defending against fascism\, the betrayal of the revolution by Commun
 ists\, and\, ultimately\, the vitality of the anarchist Idea.\n\nAll ages w
 elcome. In Spanish with English subtitles.
LAST-MODIFIED:20170106T154700Z
LOCATION:Boxcar Books
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Screening: Living Utopia: Anarchism in Spain
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
