DESCRIPTION:<br><br>"<span style="font-family: azo-sans-web\, sans-serif\; 
 color: rgb(85\, 86\, 90)\; font-size: 16px\;">Sara\, one of the world's mos
 t brilliant astrophysicists\, lives her life on Mars time — her days lastin
 g longer and longer as she monitors mankind's latest voyage to the Red Plan
 et. But her daughter\, Lis\, continues to live her life as a teenager on Ea
 rth time\, showing no interest in her mother's world out in space—despite S
 ara's best efforts. As both of their lives begin to spin out of control\, t
 hey must grapple with the distance their two time zones create between them
 ... even when they're standing side by side."</span><br><br>$10-$20<br>http
 ://newplays.org/
LAST-MODIFIED:20180227T014324Z
LOCATION:Bloomington Playwrights Project
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:A play: Out Of Orbit
TRANSP:OPAQUE
