 urgent need of a storage shed for supplies.\n\n TOP NEEDS: Storage Shed\, B
 lankets\, Toiletries\, Coats\, Hats\, etc. \n\n We will be accepting materi
 al donations at this benefit show!\n\n Suggested Donation: $5-$15\n\n *-*EV
 ENT LINEUP*-*\n\n *Sir Deja Doog (acoustic)\nhttps://sirdejadoog.bandcamp.c
 om/\n\n *Hive Mind (grindcore)\nhttps://hivemindin.bandcamp.com/\n\n *Condu
 it (local synth star)\n\n *DANCE PARTY afterwards wih Luther Blisset and DJ
  Blush\n\n Can't wait to see you there! Let's Party!\n\nhttps://www.faceboo
 k.com/events/135616193853584/
