DESCRIPTION:Have you ever seen a lion or tiger play with a pumpkin? Join us
  for the EFRC Pumpkin Party - a unique event. Watch as each of our cats get
  their own meat-filled pumpkin for lunch.  What a treat!  This only happens
  once a year.  Bring your hollowed-out\, used Halloween pumpkins (before th
 e day of Pumpkin Party) and we'll fill them with meat for our special felin
 e friends. \n\nWhat will your favorite cat do with their pumpkin?  Play wit
 h the pumpkin? Throw the pumpkin? Smash the pumpkin? Drop the Pumpkin? Eat 
 the Pumpkin? How will your cat get to the meat?  Come and find out!  Pumpki
 ns will be placed in enclosures around 12:15. \n \nPumpkin Party guests are
  invited watch the EFRC cats enjoy their pumpkin lunch from 12-2pm.  At 2pm
 \, the Rescue Center will be re-opened to the general public for tours.\n\n
 $10 adults/$5 children 12 & under\nReservations NOT needed.\n\nhttp://www.e
 xoticfelinerescuecenter.org/home.html
LAST-MODIFIED:20151102T013347Z
LOCATION:The Exotic Feline Rescue Center (2221 E Ashboro Rd\, Center Point\
 , Indiana 47840)
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Pumpkin Day at the Exotic Feline Rescue Center
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
