DESCRIPTION:PUNKS GIVE BACK PRESENTS: #8\, night of music and poetry benefi
 ting&nbsp\;<a href="https://www.facebook.com/defendj20resistance/">Defend J
 20 Resistance</a>&nbsp\;defendants based in Indiana.<br><a href="http://www
 .defendj20resistance.org/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">www.defendJ20resi
 stance.org</a><br>--------<br><br>Before and between music acts we'll be fe
 aturing a LIVE POETRY MIXTAPE curated by&nbsp\;<a href="https://www.faceboo
 k.com/isabellahbravo"><b>Bella Bravo</b></a>. Last time we hosted of these 
 is it was a really cool look into words and thoughts floating around Bloomy
 ! Poets TBA!<br><br><b>Evan Copelly</b><br>Singer-songwriter playing heartf
 elt\, often heart-wrenching tunes. Formerly of Selfish Whales<br><a href="h
 ttps://copelly.bandcamp.com/track/hard-to-answer" rel="nofollow" target="_b
 lank">https://copelly.bandcamp.com/track/hard-to-answer</a><br><br><br><b>G
 hastly Indiana</b><br>Radical jangle-punks. They took some time off to writ
 e\, record and create life&nbsp\;from genetic material\, so this is their f
 irst show in a while!<br><a href="https://ghastlyindiana.bandcamp.com/track
 /death-song-for-2016" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">https://ghastlyindiana
 .bandcamp.com/track/death-song-for-2016</a><br><br><br><br><b>About Defend 
 J20 Resistance:</b><br>On January 20th\, 230 people were mass arrested duri
 ng demonstrations against Donald Trump's Inauguration. The arrests were mad
 e by use of a "kettle" technique of individuals on the corners of L and 12t
 h Street\, without orders to disperse. 214 of these arrestees were charged 
 under the Federal Riot Statute. On April 27th\, multiple additional felony 
 charges were added. The 194 remaining defendants could now face up to 60 ye
 ars in prison.<br><br>All funds donated will go to support the expenses of 
 J20 Defendants who are based Indiana.&nbsp\;<br><br>at The Blockhouse\; 21+
 \; Cover is a $5 to $15 donation.<br>Doors at 8 pm\; Event at 9 pm sharp.<b
 r><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/blockhousebar/">https://www.faceboo
 k.com/blockhousebar/</a><br><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/events/14
 6663369443546/">FB Event Page</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20180105T162039Z
LOCATION:The Blockhouse
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Evan Copelly / Ghastly\, Indiana / Bella Bravo    21+
TRANSP:OPAQUE
