CREATED:20171124T123309Z
DESCRIPTION:\n"Every time you laugh\, an angel gets its wings. While that m
 ight not be quite the way the line from the classic holiday movie goes\, yo
 ur laughter can still support a great cause this holiday season. Join Rhino
 ’s Youth Center and All Ages Club and Uel Zing Coffee as they present “It’s
  A Wonderful Laugh” on December 22nd at 8:00pm at Rhino’s Youth Center in B
 loomington\, 331 S. Walnut Street. Hear impressionist Lance Fox do Jimmy St
 ewart and some of his other 200 voices and celebrate the comedic talents of
  David Britton\, Mark Bookwalter\, Kristen Lucas and Dave Walter as they sp
 read holiday cheer with the joy of jokes and laughter. You can even sip an 
 award-winning cold brew or frothy nitro from Uel Zing as you watch and list
 en to the comedic magic unfold. All General Admission tickets are just $15 
 and available now at the Buskirk-Chumley Theater Box Office\, 114 E. Kirkwo
 od Ave\, by calling the BCT Box Office at 812-323-3020\, or by visiting the
 m online at BCTBoxOffice.org. Tickets can also be purchased at the Door wit
 h CASH ONLY\, IF IT IS NOT SOLD OUT. Doors open at 7:30pm. All proceeds to 
 benefit Rhino’s Youth Center\, a division of Harmony Education Center\, ded
 icated to providing free and creative after school programming for all yout
 h ages 13-18. You see\, it really is a wonderful life!"\n\nhttps://www.face
 book.com/events/192421024650505/\nhttp://www.rhinosyouthcenter.org/
LAST-MODIFIED:20171124T123309Z
LOCATION:Rhinos Youth Center
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:It's a Wonderful Laugh: Comedy show
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
