 ays. You’ll learn about the educational merits of good ole’ fashioned physi
 cal comedy. You’ll be tickled by ridiculously outdated products from yester
 year. And you’ll see the hilarity that ensues from everyday miscommunicatio
 ns. So grab that rubber chicken\, put on your clown shoes\, and look out fo
 r that bananna peel in an evening full of classroom giggles.\n\nhttps://www
 .facebook.com/events/1297164647037849/\nhttp://thebishopbar.com/\n
