DESCRIPTION:Free\n\nBring your home movies and we’ll project them on the bi
 g screen! Share and celebrate your 16mm\, 8mm\, Super 8\, VHS\, DVD\, and d
 igital video home movies. Also\, see rare and unsual home movies from our c
 ollections in the Moving Image Archive. Gather for some fun\, remember yest
 eryear with friends\, and point out the people and places you recognize. Ar
 chivists will be on hand to teach proper handling and preservation procedur
 es for your personal media.\n\nhttps://www.facebook.com/events/207632912259
 7351/
