BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Let's Go! Bloomington
DTSTART:20181006T230000Z
DTEND:20181007T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041548Z
UID:3c63e2arpfd59mmfsnsrl3vls4@google.com
CREATED:20181006T154959Z
DESCRIPTION:<br>From FB<br><em>Hopscotch Coffee is pleased to present Putty
  Live Art Talk Show at our B-Line cafe on Saturday\, October 6th for an eve
 ning of televised cultural enlightenment. All are invited to be part of the
  studio audience for this unique spectacle as Putty illuminates the motivat
 ions and methods of the Bloomington creative community. In this first show 
 in a 3-show series\, host Erin K Drew will welcome painter Peter Shear\, co
 llaborative mixed media artists Rachel De Cuba and Matthew Batty\, and musi
 cal guest The Bills. <br><br>Putty is the brainchild of Indianapolis artist
  (and former Bloomington resident) Erin K Drew\, an illustrator and art edu
 cator. The program is hosted by Drew in a late-nite talk show format\, repl
 ete with musical guest. The focus of the show is arts and culture\, with gu
 ests from a variety of media and backgrounds coming to talk about their wor
 k and processes. It will be filmed by CATS (Community Access Television Ser
 vices) for later broadcast on cable access TV and online.<br><br>Putty is p
 art documentary project\, part party—a playhouse and public art piece which
  appropriates and distorts the talk show format. Originally presented at In
 dy’s State Street Pub\, Putty at Hopscotch aspires to strike a balance betw
 een entertainment and education\, in an environment naturally attuned to st
 udying and socializing—a lecture hall with zero credit hours but way better
  furniture. Over the course of three episodes\, host Erin K Drew will condu
 ct long-form interviews with some of the emerging talents and creative magn
 ates who have helped make Bloomington a luminary destination for DIY cultur
 e for the last two decades of her life. Upcoming shows in the series are pl
 anned for 12/8 &amp\; 2/2—save the dates!</em><br><br><a href="https://l.fa
 cebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fputty.neocities.org%2F&amp\;h=AT0182AQQ1C1
 bjadzigesJ7Xyb1zTggP65ntPOjHcpkj6L3_1FIVG753Kl2W0Na2SUEvLxuB8nrG68cob9TXPLi
 YJV-ndwCBdkipFeTQtPPT7bFzfJqNNCXURy-Bjp-x" target="_blank" rel="nofollow" d
 ata-lynx-mode="hover"><font color="#000080">putty.neocities.org</font></a><
 br><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/events/300277814117040/">FB EVENT<
 /a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20181006T154959Z
LOCATION:Hopscotch Coffee
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Putty: Live Art Talk Show
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
