BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Let's Go! Bloomington
DTSTART:20150730T010000Z
DTEND:20150730T033000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041548Z
UID:nrbpia2lql5kp9m63qpl0qns00@google.com
CREATED:20150726T193957Z
DESCRIPTION:ALL AGES\n\nMad Alchemy Liquid Light Show::\nhttp://www.madalch
 emy.net/#!videos/cty2\nAn analog liquid lightshow in the San Francisco trad
 ition pioneered by Bill Hamm\, and Brotherhood of Light--a main stay of the
  60's ballroom scene.\nWhen Lance Gordon first performed analog liquid ligh
 t shows in the 1970's\, he shared the stage with the likes of Roky Erickson
 \, Big Brother and the Holding Co.\, Its a Beautiful Day\, John Lee Hooker\
 , Boz Skaggs\, The Tubes\, Tower of Power\, John Cipollina\, Copperhead\, a
 nd Elvin Bishop.\n\nLee Gallagher And The Hallelujah ::\nhttps://www.youtub
 e.com/watch?v=cuDlADkn_k8\nRecently named one of the Top 5 Best Up-and-Comi
 ng Bay area bands of 2014 by CBS and most recently one of 5 bands to watch 
 in 2015 by Relix magazine.\n\nBased in San Francisco but comprised of Midwe
 stern and Southern transplants with a devotion to honest roots based Americ
 an music\, they weave a sonic tapestry framed by wailing guitars\, churning
  organ\, and more than a slight nod to the southern gospel music of their p
 ast. The band has garnered buzz for their live shows which transform tradit
 ional music venues into sweaty\, hip-shaking\, psychedelic tent revivals.\n
 \nThe band has had the incredible good fortune of sharing the stage with su
 ch acts as\, Heartless Bastards\, Jessica Hernandez & the Deltas\, and even
  The Doobie Brothers\, Boston\, and Living Colour.\n\nLee Gallagher and the
  Hallelujah will spend 2015 taking their “psychedelic gospel” on the road w
 ith a US tour starting in mid July accompanied by the world renown analog l
 iquid light show Mad Alchemy.\n\nFrankie and the Witch Fingers ::\nhttps://
 www.youtube.com/watch?v=b_erUJqD9Ek\n\nDylan channels the inner thoughts an
 d dreams of his psychedelic feline companion\, Frankie. They share a singlu
 ar MIND and channel aural colors and shapes thru the ELECTRIC SÉANCE.\n\nTh
 e "fingers" are what you would expect them to be - pieces of the GREATER BE
 ING\, bent with occult knowledge. Together they melt music onto small reels
  of tape while exploring the INFINITE realm of sound. This phenomenon was r
 eferred to by the ancient ones as...\nFRANKIE AND THE WITCH FINGERS.\nPOSTS
 \n\nBlockhouse Bloomington\n205 S College\, Bloomington\, Indiana 47404\n\n
 https://www.facebook.com/events/856523787750055/\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20150726T193957Z
LOCATION:The Blockhouse
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Mad Alchemy Liquid Light Show / Lee Gallagher and the Hallelujah / 
 Frankie and the Witchfingers
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
