DESCRIPTION:Video Boom is a collective of folks that screen movies that nev
 er made it past a VHS release. Some are gems and others are laughably ridic
 ulous. \n\nThis time we are screening a 1989 horror Christmas classic. Thre
 e mall employees are being stalked by a mutant elf created by a Nazi experi
 ment. Only a beat up old mall Santa can save them! The movie is trashy and 
 very self aware of that.It's incredibly silly and vulgar and may not be for
  all audiences. All ages but not for kids. Get there on time to see trailer
 s for upcoming screening and other Christmas-y eyeball candy! \nScreening a
 t 9:pm.\n\nTrailer: https://youtu.be/GLo795JFfpg\nhttp://itsvideoboom.tumbl
 r.com\nhttp://thevoidbloomington.tumblr.com
LAST-MODIFIED:20161215T234204Z
LOCATION:Plan Nine Video
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Video Boom Screening: "Santa's Evil Helper"
TRANSP:OPAQUE
