DESCRIPTION:What is Harm Reduction? Why are you giving out syringes? What c
 an I do to help a loved one? What are actions our community can take? How d
 id this happen? What do I do if I find a discarded syringe? Where can I get
  some Narcan? Where? How? Why? When? Is? Etc etc.\n\nCome to get your quest
 ions answered and concerns addressed. Learn about the current opioid crisis
 . Our volunteers will be available to talk about do what the do. Learn abou
 t Harm Reduction and get answers to your questions\, as well as suggestions
  about how you can get involved!\n\nFree Naloxone will be distributed!\nhtt
 p://mcpl.org
LAST-MODIFIED:20170722T184140Z
LOCATION:Monroe County Public Library
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Why Harm Reduction? A Community Discusstion
TRANSP:OPAQUE
