DESCRIPTION:from FB\n"Do you love poetry? Do you believe in the Revolution?
  Do you hate Trump? Join us at Boxcar for a night of poetry and resistance!
 \n\nThis event is a poetry open mic for queer performers. Anyone may perfor
 m as many peices as they'd like. You can either sign up on the night of or 
 email littlelemonsweets@hotmail.com to put your name on the list of perform
 ers. Anyone who is not interested in performing\, please show up and soak u
 p the queer\, radical energy! It will be a night to remember. Vegan baked g
 oods will be available to those who show up in time! I look forward to seei
 ng you all."\n\nPerformers so far:\nCori Martinez.\nJasper Far\nDarian Tann
 er\nChey Tank\nEvelyn Gabrielle Smith\n\nhttp://boxcarbooks.org\nhttps://ww
 w.facebook.com/events/1798409383817451/
LAST-MODIFIED:20170218T043047Z
LOCATION:Boxcar Books
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Queer as in Fuck You: Poetry For the Revolution
TRANSP:OPAQUE
