DESCRIPTION:Bloomington Zinefest 2017 is an event celebrating self-publishi
 ng culture in Indiana and beyond by providing space for writers\, artists\,
  radicals\, and other exhibitors to sell their zines and participate in wor
 kshops. There will be tables from local and regional distros and publishers
  as well as reading\, discussions\, and workshops throughout the day. All p
 roceeds will go to local prisoner support projects!\n\nIt will be taking pl
 ace on April 8\, from 11-6 at The Void\, an all-ages\, volunteer run\, coll
 ective DIY space in Bloomington\, Indiana.\n\nAfterwards there will be a be
 nefit show in the evening\, also at The Void (details TBA). All proceeds wi
 ll go to a local project that sends monthly stipends to prisoners.\n\nRegis
 tration is now open: https://bloomingtonzinefest2017.wordpress.com/contact/
 \nhttp://boxcarbooks.org\nhttps://www.facebook.com/events/170807183411019/\
 nhttp://thevoidbloomington.tumblr.com
LAST-MODIFIED:20170319T130106Z
LOCATION:The Void
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Whelmed / Evan Copelly / Solid State Physics / Wintermute
TRANSP:OPAQUE
