DESCRIPTION:From FB\nDetails\nSee The World\, Feed Your Mind: Animated Shor
 ts (2013–2015)\nDirected by Various Directors\nSaturday\, November 12\, 201
 6 3:00 p.m.\n\nZip around the world with these high-energy\, high-imaginati
 on animated shorts from the 2016 Children’s Film Festival Seattle. You’ll b
 e dazzled by the light\, color\, and storytelling in this vibrant celebrati
 on of creativity. Meet the world’s tidiest mouse\, see sushi come to life\,
  fly high in the sky with a flock of birds\, watch out for trouble in a wac
 ky barnyard\, make music with a jazzy octopus\, and see how kindness can ch
 ange the day. Two films have brief foreign language segments with subtitles
 . (HD Presentation)\n\nTickets are free (but required) for children age 12 
 and younger\, all other tickets are $3. Tickets available August 8\, 2016.
LAST-MODIFIED:20161106T043708Z
LOCATION:IU Cinema
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Screening: See the World\, Feed Your Mind. Animated Shorts
TRANSP:OPAQUE
