DESCRIPTION:From FB:\n\nKeep it simple! 75 + makers\nBath & Body\nChildren'
 s Items\nHoliday Items\nT-Shirts\nCeramics\nJewelry\nJournals\nHousewares\n
 our Micro Market featuring emerging makers from Indiana University and Ivy 
 Tech\nFUN STUFF and quite simply\, COUNTLESS amounts of fun!!!\n\n---------
 -----------------\n\nThe Bloomington Handmade Market is a juried indie craf
 t fair that showcases 75+ artists from all over the Midwest. The only craft
  fair of it's kind in Bloomington\, you'll find things like silkscreened sh
 irts and posters\, a wide array of jewelry\, plush creatures\, art prints\,
  colorful ceramics\, handbound books\, bags and purses\, cards\, items for 
 children\, handmade soaps\, original art\, and more!\n\nThe upcoming holida
 y show will be the 15th BHM event\, with artists coming from all over the M
 idwest.\n\nThe Convention Center is located at 3rd and College and free par
 king is available on site. Admission to BHM is free and open to the public!
  Please note that while many of our vendors have the means to accept credit
  cards\, not all of them do\, so bring plenty of cash!\nhttps://www.faceboo
 k.com/events/139036930058352/
LAST-MODIFIED:20171105T154932Z
LOCATION:Bloomington Convention Center
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Handmade Market
TRANSP:OPAQUE
