DESCRIPTION:For this session we will be discussing: ‘Escapism Has Its Price
 \, the Artist Has His Income’ from the French “Non Fides\; N°4” journal. “R
 ead and Revolt” is a reading group that facilitates discussions about this 
 society and the potential for liberation from an anarchist perspective. The
  discussions take place the first and third Tuesdays of each month at Boxca
 r Books\, starting at 7 PM. All are invited!\n\nA free printout of the text
  for each upcoming session will be provided at Boxcar Books for two weeks b
 eforehand. This one is short\, and can be found here:\nhttps://theanarchist
 library.org/library/non-fides-escapism-has-its-price-the-artist-has-his-inc
 om\n\nhttp://boxcarbook.org
LAST-MODIFIED:20170420T124511Z
LOCATION:Boxcar Books 
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Read & Revolt : Escapism Has Its Price
TRANSP:OPAQUE
