BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Let's Go! Bloomington
DTSTART:20161109T000000Z
DTEND:20161109T043000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041548Z
UID:hfbuq12nsa9o3blc1rospd9cho@google.com
CREATED:20161005T190506Z
DESCRIPTION:From the FB page:\n2016 has been both a garbage-fire year and a
 n election year so we're holding court for election night to give people a 
 place to be near each other and soak up the coverage together.\n\ni remembe
 r when i first moved to Bloomington i went to election night at Rachael's a
 nd it was good to experience that tension and uncertainty around open-minde
 d folks\, liberals and queers. so this is an attempt to recreate that since
  i wasn't guaranteed it was going to happen in any place that isn't a bar.\
 n\nthis was going to be a show\, but there are A LOT of shows that week alr
 eady. so instead we're going to stream the coverage live\, have the bar ope
 n\, maybe have some vendors with food and offer light forms of entertainmen
 t and comfort. if you want to offer to make everyone cookies or paint folks
 ' nails or do tarot readings or something\, that might be cool too.\n\ni do
 n't have any firm standards on what this becomes other than i want it to be
  something that the community needs. so let us know your needs and let's sh
 ape this event together. ♥\n\nNOTE: this event won't be pro-any particular 
 candidate but it's definitely anti-Trump.\n\nthis event is ALL AGES - FREE 
 - there will be snacks and drinks and booze on sell (if you're 21+) to bene
 fit the space\n\nPLEASE TREAT EACH OTHER WELL ♥\n\nhttps://www.facebook.com
 /events/689113857903401/
LAST-MODIFIED:20161005T190506Z
LOCATION:The Void
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Storm Shelter: Election Night
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
