DESCRIPTION:Free!\n\nFrom the IU Cinema Site: \n\nNo More Road Trips? is an
  interactive cinematic journey from the Atlantic Coast to California made f
 rom a collection of 9\,000 home movies. The film and live commentary reveal
  hidden histories embedded in the landscape and seeks to blend the pleasure
 s of travel with premonitions of its end. Director\, Preservationist\, and 
 Archive Founder Rick Prelinger is scheduled to be present. (HD Presentation
 )\n\nhttp://www.cinema.indiana.edu/?post_type=film&p=11981
