UID:bljc191brcaumh21gmqm2f06i8@google.com
CREATED:20151102T010437Z
DESCRIPTION:8pm: INSTANT GRATIFICATION MOVIE CHALLENGE\n-Each month we choo
 se a theme and open the challenge up to anyone who wants to make a movie an
 d submit. We screen them all and then add them to our archive. It's a ton o
 f fun. For the Gadabout we decide to aptly theme it "UNLUCKY". \nMAKE A MOV
 IE!! All films due at the screening. More info at:\nmonthlymoviechallenge.c
 om\n\n10pm: MUSIC VIDEOS\n-This is the 3rd time we have curated a music vid
 eo only program. Music videos can be very cinematic\, but are not bound by 
 normal rules of cinema. They can be beautiful\, gritty\, funny\, and have r
 oom for some truly creative filmmaking. Featuring videos from: Mike Adams a
 t His Honest Weight\, High Dive\, Amy O\, Bad Psychic\, The Max Levine Ense
 mble\, and more...\n\nhttp://gadaboutfilmfest.com/
LAST-MODIFIED:20151113T153415Z
LOCATION:The Fell Building (415 W 4th St.)
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:13th Annual Gadabout Film Fest
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
