 chased at the door with cash only.\n\nFIND TICKETS AT:\ncardinalstage.org\n
 812.336.9300\nCardinal Stage Company Box Office (900 S Walnut St.)\nBCT Box
  Office (114 E. Kirkwood Ave.)\n\nProceeds from this event will benefit Car
 dinal's Education and Outreach programs including the IU Credit Union Educa
 tion Initiative\, the Cardinal for Kids series of plays for young audiences
 \, and the Student Matinee Program for local high school students. For more
  information about these vital programs\, please visit cardinalstage.org/ou
 treach. \n\nMore info at cardinalstage.org.\nhttps://www.facebook.com/event
 s/349743332144855/
