 elsea Jean (of Ladycop)\nhttp://www.ldycpmusic.com/\nhttps://ldycp.bandcamp
 .com/releases\nChelsea Jean is the songwriter/lead vocalist of the Blooming
 ton-based neo-pop project Ladycop. Looping three part harmony and keyboard 
