 he release of Ladycop's 'Undercurrent EP' via Tree Machine Records November
  11th.\n\n!mindparade\nhttp://www.mindparade.us/\nhttps://mindparade.bandca
 mp.com/album/dead-mystics-lp\nFall down the rabbit hole with Bloomington's 
 own neo-psych/dream rock outfit led by Alex Arnold (Jefferson St. Parade Ba
 nd\, Ladycop\, Black Acid Arkestra).\n\nIn Flight (Asheville\, NC)\nhttps:/
 /soundcloud.com/inflightgroup\nJammers hailing from Asheville\, NC will clo
 se out the night with a set of instrumental jazz/americana fusion. Revolvin
 g around original compositions and open improvisation\, the group blends a 
 variety of influences.
