DESCRIPTION:From FB:<br><br>Pages is returning to the library in January to
  pack up more books for Indiana prisoners and we'd love if you joined us!&n
 bsp\;<br><br><br>New and old volunteers are welcome! Volunteers will have a
 lready chosen the books\, but we need people to write letters and warp them
  up! Stop by for a minute\, or the whole time.&nbsp\;<br><br>We'll have mor
 e information as the event gets closer about orientation that will be avail
 able for interested folks.<br><br>Please invite your friends and help us sp
 read the word!&nbsp\;<br><br>Pages is currently (and always) in need of dic
 tionaries! Even if you can’t stay to do a package we’d love if you dropped 
 off a dictionary! Our most highly requested book!&nbsp\;<br><br>Stamps are 
 also very welcome and always useful!&nbsp\;<br><br>Monday\, January 21\, 20
 19<br>Monroe County Library<br>Room 1C<br>3 - 7 PM<br><br>Feel free to e-ma
 il with any questions!&nbsp\;<br>midwestppp@gmail.com<br><a href="https://w
 ww.facebook.com/events/587394335032291/" id="ow1271" __is_owner="true">FB L
 INK</a>
