DESCRIPTION:Free! All Ages!\n"Bloomington Zinefest 2017 is an event celebra
 ting self-publishing culture in Indiana and beyond by providing space for w
 riters\, artists\, radicals\, and other exhibitors to sell their zines and 
 participate in workshops. There will be tables from local and regional dist
 ros and publishers as well as reading\, discussions\, and workshops through
 out the day. All proceeds will go to local prisoner support projects!"\n\nI
 t will be taking place on April 8\, from 11-6 at The Void\, an all-ages\, v
 olunteer run\, collective DIY space in Bloomington\, Indiana.\n\nAfterwards
  there will be a benefit show at 8pm\, also at The Void. Punks Give Back! N
 o. 2: Chainsaw Mondays\, Whelmed\, Solid State Physics\, and Wintermute.\n\
 nThere will be food trucks in between\, from 5-8pm and a bake sale going th
 roughout the day.\n\nAll proceeds will go to a local project that sends mon
 thly stipends to prisoners.\n\nRegistration is now open: https://bloomingto
 nzinefest2017.wordpress.com/contact/\nhttp://thevoidbloomington.tumblr.com\
 nhttps://www.facebook.com/events/170807183411019/
LAST-MODIFIED:20170319T130316Z
LOCATION:The Void
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Bloomington Zine Fest 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
