CREATED:20171201T224316Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a festive evening of short films\, curated by us\, 
 to bring you the essence of a British Christmas! \n\n First 40 people in th
 e door receive a Christmas Cracker. A British tradition filled with surpris
 es! \n\n It's been quite a year- we're capping it off with some holiday-the
 med fun and merriment. Bring a friend\, your appetite for English treats\, 
 and get cozy as we say "cheers!" to 2017.\n\n This marks our final event at
  The Void as we embark on the next exciting chapter in 2018. Thanks to a BU
 AE Zone Arts Grant we will soon be popping up in a variety of exciting venu
 es around town! As we say goodbye to our beloved home at the Void\, we do h
 ope you will come out to celebrate the holidays with some (very) British cl
 assics and curios. It's been a strange\, joyful\, wild year for us and we'v
 e been able to do all of this through your continued support. \n\n Now let'
 s have a Proper Crimbo!\n\n$5 Suggested Donation\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20171201T224316Z
LOCATION:The Void
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Cicada Cinema presents A Very British Christmas
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
