DESCRIPTION:<b>“Shrek”</b> PG (1h 35m)<br>Show time is 9:45<br><br>Weekday 
 gates open @ 8:45<br><br>Retro Single Feature pricing:<br>13 &amp\; older $
 4<br>6-12 $2<br>5 &amp\; under Free <br><br>Please read below for our Covid
 -19 Action Plan!<br><br>Tickets are now available online @ <a href="https:/
 /l.facebook.com/l.php?u=http%3A%2F%2FKJBTheaters.com%2F%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR2wGz
 fdybug44WUcrX8L8uPLubjCKKiiDSs3-tXZ5MDmu_13DQ6dHUCKlE&h=AT1EojVzFGUszVHjnbe
 rT4g72BAA1GuT_AYbT0oYXgh3qwcgieV1WNdlt6R3ESJE73_HJHgK8reJ1xhBvRGNw7x2Ql5dGN
 q8K6e52B5fum_SguyG65UsZXGktyR-RCT_1w&__tn__=-UK-R&c[0]=AT0fRmNQd9DnDEjel4aR
 -duDD9ztFP_dE6tatI7OAhVEcf0pTKMtvm926fPx5W88vvI_ojZgMUVWQJ-erl4yj8ic0nd8js9
 NRvC9qVUDucbAfsaq0j0zNLi6h6ALPHdCcpmO4gMNzWwcuPr-wQmbVEHfiPe6j_vlOt_MA2Xr-k
 sAzdfGN79xyADGvlhH" target="_blank">KJBTheaters.com.</a> We encourage onlin
 e ticket purchases as this will cut down on contact at the Box Office. All 
 you have to do is show our Box Office Attendant your confirmation email   (
 either a print out or on your mobile device) we will scan that which will c
 onfirm your purchase with us. Tickets will not be given out unless requeste
 d. Box Office employees will wear masks. **Please make sure you select the 
 correct date for your visit and that you enter your email address correctly
 . You will not receive a confirmation if anything is misspelled.**<br><br>W
 ith over 7 acres we have plenty of room to social distance. Purchasing tick
 ets online DOES guarantee a spot\, but you will want to arrive early in ord
 er to get the spot of your choice. Cars must be parked 6 feet away from eac
 hother. You may lift your hatch or sit in back of trucks. If hatch is open 
 as always we ask you to tie the hatch so that it is even with the roof of y
 our vehicle so that fellow patrons behind you can see the screen. You can n
 ot sit in chairs beside your vehicle\, but you can sit in front of it. <br>
 Restrooms will be limited to 2 at a time and will be sanitized every 15 min
 utes. <br>Our concession stand will be open. We will have markings on our f
 loor encouraging a safe distance of 6 feet between groups. Our staff will w
 ear masks. Anytime you visit the restrooms or concession stands we ask that
  you do the same. <br>Drink and Popcorn refills will now be offered at .50 
 each at this time. We will have to provide a new Cup\, Bag or Tub and will 
 have to have original item returned to concession stand for disposal. <br>L
 et&#39\;s all work together to make sure that we can remain open and enjoy 
 movies once again under the stars. <br><a href="http://goog_439325322" targ
 et="_blank"><br></a><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/Starlite-Drive-In
 -Theater-115264228499207/?hc_ref=SEARCH" target="_blank">FB PAGE</a><br><u>
 <a href="http://starlitebloomington.com" target="_blank">OFFICIAL PAGE</a><
 /u>
