CREATED:20200722T131959Z
DESCRIPTION:Weekday gates open @ 8:45<br>Movies start at 9:45pm<br><i>Check
  website or FB for movie order</i><br><br>Retro Single Feature pricing:<br>
 13 &amp\; older $4<br>6-12 $2<br>5 &amp\; under Free <br><br>Please read be
 low for our Covid-19 Action Plan!<br><br>Tickets are now available online @
  <a href="https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=http%3A%2F%2FKJBTheaters.com%2F%3F
 fbclid%3DIwAR2wGzfdybug44WUcrX8L8uPLubjCKKiiDSs3-tXZ5MDmu_13DQ6dHUCKlE&h=AT
 1EojVzFGUszVHjnberT4g72BAA1GuT_AYbT0oYXgh3qwcgieV1WNdlt6R3ESJE73_HJHgK8reJ1
 xhBvRGNw7x2Ql5dGNq8K6e52B5fum_SguyG65UsZXGktyR-RCT_1w&__tn__=-UK-R&c[0]=AT0
 fRmNQd9DnDEjel4aR-duDD9ztFP_dE6tatI7OAhVEcf0pTKMtvm926fPx5W88vvI_ojZgMUVWQJ
 -erl4yj8ic0nd8js9NRvC9qVUDucbAfsaq0j0zNLi6h6ALPHdCcpmO4gMNzWwcuPr-wQmbVEHfi
 Pe6j_vlOt_MA2Xr-ksAzdfGN79xyADGvlhH" target="_blank">KJBTheaters.com.</a> W
 e encourage online ticket purchases as this will cut down on contact at the
  Box Office. All you have to do is show our Box Office Attendant your confi
 rmation email   (either a print out or on your mobile device) we will scan 
 that which will confirm your purchase with us. Tickets will not be given ou
 t unless requested. Box Office employees will wear masks. **Please make sur
 e you select the correct date for your visit and that you enter your email 
 address correctly. You will not receive a confirmation if anything is missp
 elled.**<br><br>With over 7 acres we have plenty of room to social distance
 . Purchasing tickets online DOES guarantee a spot\, but you will want to ar
 rive early in order to get the spot of your choice. Cars must be parked 6 f
 eet away from each other. You may lift your hatch or sit in back of trucks.
  If hatch is open as always we ask you to tie the hatch so that it is even 
 with the roof of your vehicle so that fellow patrons behind you can see the
  screen. You can not sit in chairs beside your vehicle\, but you can sit in
  front of it. <br>Restrooms will be limited to 2 at a time and will be sani
 tized every 15 minutes. <br>Our concession stand will be open. We will have
  markings on our floor encouraging a safe distance of 6 feet between groups
 . Our staff will wear masks. Anytime you visit the restrooms or concession 
 stands we ask that you do the same. <br>Drink and Popcorn refills will now 
 be offered at .50 each at this time. We will have to provide a new Cup\, Ba
 g or Tub and will have to have original item returned to concession stand f
 or disposal. <br>Let&#39\;s all work together to make sure that we can rema
 in open and enjoy movies once again under the stars. <br><a href="http://go
 og_439325322" target="_blank"><br></a><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com
 /Starlite-Drive-In-Theater-115264228499207/?hc_ref=SEARCH" target="_blank">
 FB PAGE</a><br><u><a href="http://starlitebloomington.com" target="_blank">
 OFFICIAL PAGE</a></u>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200722T131959Z
LOCATION:Starlite Drive-In Theatre
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Screening Double Feature: Evil Dead / Army of Darkness
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
