DESCRIPTION:From the website:<br><br><p><span></span>Five years after winni
 ng the Palme d’Or for Shoplifters\, Academy award nominated filmmaker Hirok
 azu Kore-eda (<em>Shoplifters</em>\, <em>Still Walking</em>) returns with <
 em>Broker\, </em>starring Cannes Best actor winner Song Kang Ho (<em>Parasi
 te</em>). The film follows two brokers who sell orphaned infants\, circumve
 nting the bureaucracy of legal adoption\, to affluent couples who can’t hav
 e children of their own. After an infant’s mother surprises the duo by retu
 rning to ensure her child finds a good home\, the three embark on a journey
  to find the right couple\, building an unlikely family of their own"<br></
 p><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vm3B-fDc9Xw">Trailer</a></p><
 p>8:pm $7 All Ages!<br></p><p><a href="https://cicadacinema.com/products/br
 oker">Event Page</a><br></p><span>                            <details>    
             <summary>                  </summary></details></span>
