 he television show\, while introducing new faces as well\, <i>The X-Files</
 i> delivers a fun\, thrilling adventure for fans and newbies alike! And rem
 ember: the truth is out there. [121 min\; sci-fi\, thriller\; Alien and Eng
 lish]  <br><a href="https://youtu.be/2Dauoy3H764">Trailer</a><br><br>Part o
