DESCRIPTION:<b>“Despicable Me”</b> PG (1h 35m)<br>Show time is 9:45<br><br>
 Followed by:<br><b>“Shrek”</b> PG (1h 35m)<br>Show time is 11:40<br><br><br
 >Weekday gates open @ 8:45<br><br>Retro Single Feature pricing:<br>13 &amp\
 ; older $4<br>6-12 $2<br>5 &amp\; under Free <br><br>Please read below for 
 our Covid-19 Action Plan!<br><br>Tickets are now available online @ <a href
 ="https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=http%3A%2F%2FKJBTheaters.com%2F%3Ffbclid%3
 DIwAR2wGzfdybug44WUcrX8L8uPLubjCKKiiDSs3-tXZ5MDmu_13DQ6dHUCKlE&h=AT1EojVzFG
 UszVHjnberT4g72BAA1GuT_AYbT0oYXgh3qwcgieV1WNdlt6R3ESJE73_HJHgK8reJ1xhBvRGNw
 7x2Ql5dGNq8K6e52B5fum_SguyG65UsZXGktyR-RCT_1w&__tn__=-UK-R&c[0]=AT0fRmNQd9D
 nDEjel4aR-duDD9ztFP_dE6tatI7OAhVEcf0pTKMtvm926fPx5W88vvI_ojZgMUVWQJ-erl4yj8
 ic0nd8js9NRvC9qVUDucbAfsaq0j0zNLi6h6ALPHdCcpmO4gMNzWwcuPr-wQmbVEHfiPe6j_vlO
 t_MA2Xr-ksAzdfGN79xyADGvlhH" target="_blank">KJBTheaters.com.</a> We encour
 age online ticket purchases as this will cut down on contact at the Box Off
 ice. All you have to do is show our Box Office Attendant your confirmation 
 email   (either a print out or on your mobile device) we will scan that whi
 ch will confirm your purchase with us. Tickets will not be given out unless
  requested. Box Office employees will wear masks. **Please make sure you se
 lect the correct date for your visit and that you enter your email address 
 correctly. You will not receive a confirmation if anything is misspelled.**
 <br><br>With over 7 acres we have plenty of room to social distance. Purcha
 sing tickets online DOES guarantee a spot\, but you will want to arrive ear
 ly in order to get the spot of your choice. Cars must be parked 6 feet away
  from eachother. You may lift your hatch or sit in back of trucks. If hatch
  is open as always we ask you to tie the hatch so that it is even with the 
 roof of your vehicle so that fellow patrons behind you can see the screen. 
 You can not sit in chairs beside your vehicle\, but you can sit in front of
  it. <br>Restrooms will be limited to 2 at a time and will be sanitized eve
 ry 15 minutes. <br>Our concession stand will be open. We will have markings
  on our floor encouraging a safe distance of 6 feet between groups. Our sta
 ff will wear masks. Anytime you visit the restrooms or concession stands we
  ask that you do the same. <br>Drink and Popcorn refills will now be offere
 d at .50 each at this time. We will have to provide a new Cup\, Bag or Tub 
 and will have to have original item returned to concession stand for dispos
 al. <br>Let&#39\;s all work together to make sure that we can remain open a
 nd enjoy movies once again under the stars. <br><a href="http://goog_439325
 322" target="_blank"><br></a><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/Starlite
 -Drive-In-Theater-115264228499207/?hc_ref=SEARCH" target="_blank">FB PAGE</
 a><br><u><a href="http://starlitebloomington.com" target="_blank">OFFICIAL 
 PAGE</a></u>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200718T153545Z
LOCATION:Starlite Drive-In Theatre
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Screening Double Feature: Shrek / Dispicable Me
TRANSP:OPAQUE
