 s to prisoners solidarity project based in Bloomington\, IN\, which serves 
 folks locked up in 10 states throughout the Midwest.&nbsp\;<br>Folks who at
 tend this event will write response letters and mail books\, zines\, &amp\;
  resource guides to prisoners locked up in Indiana prisons &amp\; Jails. Or
 ientation and Instruction provided.&nbsp\;<br><br>Donations of postage stam
 ps and dictionaries are appreciated.&nbsp\;<br><br>17 E Franklin St\, Spenc
 er\, IN All Ages 6-8pm<br><a href="https://pagestoprisoners.org/">https://p
 agestoprisoners.org/</a>
