  she creates a podcast to interview the local artists she adores\, Lennon d
 iscovers her own musical ambitions\, develops a fast friendship with the st
 riking\, confident performer Bobbi Kitten\, and in the process creates an i
 dentity not wholly her own. Soon\, Lennon’s aspirations\, with some constru
 ctive coaxing from Bobbi to find her voice\, lead her down a path of dark o
 bsession. <a href="https://youtu.be/YfwqoSaSlVY" id="ow2283" __is_owner="tr
 ue">Trailer</a></span><br><span>&nbsp\;</span><br><span>9:pm $7 21+<br></sp
