DESCRIPTION:The duplicitous Jade Cochran embarks on a new life with a trave
 ling carnival after being fed up with her life as a waitress. However\, aft
 er her fresh start she discovers that what lurks behind the curtain doesn’t
  take too kindly to her backstabbing plans. Called a “A sleazy\, partial re
 make of Tod Browning’s Freaks” by writer Michael Weldon\, She Freak&#39\;&#
 39\; an eye-poppingly colorful gutter noir as love letter to the carnival l
 ifestyle featuring the swinging sounds of the 60’s.Sourced from the origina
 l camera negative and restored into beautiful 4K by AGFA and “Something Wei
 rd.” <br> <br>7:30 and 10:pm $5 18+<br><a href="https://www.google.com/url?
 q=https://cicadacinema.com/&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;
 usg=AOvVaw03H0-EFc3s9gIMAOEue-5e" target="_blank">Event Page </a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20220828T152852Z
LOCATION:The Orbit Room
