 'll print it for you*. Visit&nbsp\;<a href="https://mcpl.info/3D">mcpl.info
 /3D</a>&nbsp\;for tutorials and resources. Please note\, 3D printing takes 
 time—you will need to return to the Library at a later date to pick up your
  creation.<br><br>*Print time restrictions and&nbsp\;<a href="https://mcpl.
 info/geninfo/monroe-county-public-library-3d-printer-policy">the Library’s 
 3D printer policy apply</a>.&nbsp\;One printed item per Library cardholder 
 per month. For size constraints and other questions\, email <a href="mailto
