DESCRIPTION:Join w/ the trees + tender heart club for the 1st installment o
 f our new reading series / happening <br>~SYZYGY~ <br><br>Readings by two w
 riters from Indianapolis:<br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/bree.joann">
 Bree Jo'ann</a> <br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100015
 104144897">Malikah Briah</a><br>featuring art responding to their work by M
 eg Hart <br>musical interludes provided by <a href="https://www.facebook.co
 m/carl.hesser.186">Cridders Cridders</a><br>Bella Bravo<br>Rose Wehrenberg<
 br>WLS<br><br>From FB:<br><i>SYZYGY is a community-centered\, expression-di
 verse reading and performance series based in Bloomington\, Indiana. The se
 ries joins local\, regional\, and continent-wide writers &amp\; artists in 
 the vital ritual of getting together to figure out how to get together\,* i
 n celebration of the we hidden in and by the singular I. <br><br>The series
  re-imagines&nbsp\;the model of literary events that presumes that the perf
 ormance is the sole work of the artist rather than the collective power tha
 t brings so much joy to bear. By hosting events in community spaces\, SYZYG
 Y tries to bring sometimes-partitioned forms of artistic expression into co
 nversation\, collaboration\, &amp\; conjunction with daily life\, in hopes 
 of course contributing to some sort of collective wisdom-in-process.<br><br
 >The word syzygy combines syn- (in Greek "with\, together with") and zyg- (
 "yoke”)\, and roughly means in English: connection even if in opposition. <
 br><br>SYZYGY is supported by the BUEA Zone Arts Grant.</i><br><i><br></i><
 br><i>7:30 </i>(Ask around for address) All Ages<br><a href="https://www.fa
 cebook.com/events/477881709758138/" id="ow1870" __is_owner="true">FB EVENT<
 /a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200222T142713Z
LOCATION:Bäbs
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:SYZYGY w/ Bree Jo'ann / Malikah Briah / Cridders Cridders / Bella B
 ravo / Rose Wherenberg / WLS
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
