UID:168gtnuqr5jpmsthe4fc8t6jmv@google.com
CREATED:20200718T153357Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><br>Weekday gates open @ 8:45<br>Movies start at 9:45pm<br>
 <i>Check website or FB for movie order</i><br><br>Retro Single Feature pric
 ing:<br>13 &amp\; older $4<br>6-12 $2<br>5 &amp\; under Free <br><br>Please
  read below for our Covid-19 Action Plan!<br><br>Tickets are now available 
 online @ <a href="https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=http%3A%2F%2FKJBTheaters.c
 om%2F%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR2wGzfdybug44WUcrX8L8uPLubjCKKiiDSs3-tXZ5MDmu_13DQ6dHUC
 KlE&h=AT1EojVzFGUszVHjnberT4g72BAA1GuT_AYbT0oYXgh3qwcgieV1WNdlt6R3ESJE73_HJ
 HgK8reJ1xhBvRGNw7x2Ql5dGNq8K6e52B5fum_SguyG65UsZXGktyR-RCT_1w&__tn__=-UK-R&
 c[0]=AT0fRmNQd9DnDEjel4aR-duDD9ztFP_dE6tatI7OAhVEcf0pTKMtvm926fPx5W88vvI_oj
 ZgMUVWQJ-erl4yj8ic0nd8js9NRvC9qVUDucbAfsaq0j0zNLi6h6ALPHdCcpmO4gMNzWwcuPr-w
 QmbVEHfiPe6j_vlOt_MA2Xr-ksAzdfGN79xyADGvlhH">KJBTheaters.com.</a> We encour
 age online ticket purchases as this will cut down on contact at the Box Off
 ice. All you have to do is show our Box Office Attendant your confirmation 
 email   (either a print out or on your mobile device) we will scan that whi
 ch will confirm your purchase with us. Tickets will not be given out unless
  requested. Box Office employees will wear masks. **Please make sure you se
 lect the correct date for your visit and that you enter your email address 
 correctly. You will not receive a confirmation if anything is misspelled.**
 <br><br>With over 7 acres we have plenty of room to social distance. Purcha
 sing tickets online DOES guarantee a spot\, but you will want to arrive ear
 ly in order to get the spot of your choice. Cars must be parked 6 feet away
  from each other. You may lift your hatch or sit in back of trucks. If hatc
 h is open as always we ask you to tie the hatch so that it is even with the
  roof of your vehicle so that fellow patrons behind you can see the screen.
  You can not sit in chairs beside your vehicle\, but you can sit in front o
 f it. <br>Restrooms will be limited to 2 at a time and will be sanitized ev
 ery 15 minutes. <br>Our concession stand will be open. We will have marking
 s on our floor encouraging a safe distance of 6 feet between groups. Our st
 aff will wear masks. Anytime you visit the restrooms or concession stands w
 e ask that you do the same. <br>Drink and Popcorn refills will now be offer
 ed at .50 each at this time. We will have to provide a new Cup\, Bag or Tub
  and will have to have original item returned to concession stand for dispo
 sal. <br>Let's all work together to make sure that we can remain open and e
 njoy movies once again under the stars.&nbsp\;<br><a href="http://goog_4393
 25322"><br></a><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/Starlite-Drive-In-Thea
 ter-115264228499207/?hc_ref=SEARCH">FB PAGE</a><br><u><a href="http://starl
 itebloomington.com">OFFICIAL PAGE</a></u>
LAST-MODIFIED:20200722T131919Z
LOCATION:Starlite Drive-In Theatre
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Screening Double Feature: Evil Dead / Army of Darkness
TRANSP:OPAQUE
