 eated BLOOD FOR DRACULA\, a sumptuously depraved Euroshocker that tows the 
 line between art and bad taste. Desperate for virgin blood\, Count Dracula 
 (Kier) journeys to an Italian villa only to discover the family’s three you
 ng daughters are also coveted by the estate’s Marxist stud (Joe Dallesandro
  of Morrissey’s FLESH FOR FRANKENSTEIN). Stefania Casini (SUSPIRIA) and BIC
 YCLE THIEVES director Vittorio De Sica co-star in one of the most unique an
 d outrageous vampire films in history.<br>&nbsp\;7:30pm $5 21+<br><a href="
 https://cicadacinema.com/products/blood-for-dracula-october-27-orbit-room-7
 -30pm" id="ow3475" __is_owner="true">Event Page</a> </html-blob>
