DESCRIPTION:From the website:<ul><li>Format: In-Person\, outside<br></li><l
 i>Cost: $50 for the public\, or $40 for Bloominglabs members&nbsp\;</li><li
 >Maximum Class Size: 3 students</li></ul><p>Plant towers are vertical garde
 n that can house 50+ plants in 4 sq ft of space. Plant towers also contain 
 a composting tube to allow users to easily return their vegetative waste ba
 ck to their plants.</p><p>Participants will build their own plant tower and
  compost tube from a recycled food-grade barrel. 2-hour class. All material
 s provided.</p><p><a href="http://www.bloominglabs.org/index.php/Workshops"
  id="ow3051" __is_owner="true">http://www.bloominglabs.org/index.php/Worksh
 ops</a></p>
