UID:hgmtoi0l5hmua7i3a2125vlj4c@google.com
CREATED:20081124T142731Z
DESCRIPTION:ABIKU (not to be confused with Steve Shelley’s pre-Sonic Youth 
 outfit\, Strange Fruit/Abiku) are a co-ed duo who from Philadelphia\, but c
 urrently residing in Baltimore. The duo brings two hardcores together: rave
  and punk. Shimmering keyboards straight off a 1987 techno track by Derrick
  May or Juan Atkins collide with Vincents furious screeches\, bellows\, and
  retches. Pretty little synth intros are obliterated by backdraft blasts of
  guitar. Tempos careen into the 200-bpm-and-up range. Songs top out at abou
 t a minute and a half.\nmyspace.com/abiku\n<br><br>\nPURRICANE (Chicago\, I
 L)\nmyspace.com/purricane\n<br><br>\nBROTHER DOLPHIN (everywhere)\n<br><br>
 \nDUST FROM 1000 YEARS\nmyspace.com/dustfrom1000yrs\n<br><br>\nGLASS LIONS\
 n<br><br>\n..maybe more?? Anyone is welcome to play!!!!\n<br><br>\n($3-7 su
 ggested donation)
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T050804Z
LOCATION:Open House\, 1205 S. Walnut St.
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Abiku\, Purricane\, Bro Do\, Dust From 1000 Yrs\, Glass Lions
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
