 ou have to do is show our Box Office Attendant your confirmation email   (e
 ither a print out or on your mobile device) we will scan that which will co
 nfirm your purchase with us. Tickets will not be given out unless requested
 . Box Office employees will wear masks. **Please make sure you select the c
 orrect date for your visit and that you enter your email address correctly.
  You will not receive a confirmation if anything is misspelled.**<br><br>Wi
 th over 7 acres we have plenty of room to social distance. Purchasing ticke
 ts online DOES guarantee a spot\, but you will want to arrive early in orde
 r to get the spot of your choice. Cars must be parked 6 feet away from each
 other. You may lift your hatch or sit in back of trucks. If hatch is open a
 s always we ask you to tie the hatch so that it is even with the roof of yo
 ur vehicle so that fellow patrons behind you can see the screen. You can no
 t sit in chairs beside your vehicle\, but you can sit in front of it. <br>R
 estrooms will be limited to 2 at a time and will be sanitized every 15 minu
 tes. <br>Our concession stand will be open. We will have markings on our fl
 oor encouraging a safe distance of 6 feet between groups. Our staff will we
 ar masks. Anytime you visit the restrooms or concession stands we ask that 
 you do the same. <br>Drink and Popcorn refills will now be offered at .50 e
 ach at this time. We will have to provide a new Cup\, Bag or Tub and will h
 ave to have original item returned to concession stand for disposal. <br>Le
 t's all work together to make sure that we can remain open and enjoy movies
  once again under the stars.&nbsp\;<br><a href="http://goog_439325322"><br>
 </a><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/Starlite-Drive-In-Theater-1152642
 28499207/?hc_ref=SEARCH">FB PAGE</a><br><u><a href="http://starliteblooming
 ton.com">OFFICIAL PAGE</a></u>
