CREATED:20190526T202851Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><i>From the FB event page:&nbsp\;</i><br>"BEST OF" Short Fi
 lm Screening! FREE admissions<br><br>Celebrating a decade of film making\, 
 this June marks the 10th anniversary of the Instant Gratification Movie Cha
 llenge. Each month there is a theme picked and all have been welcome to mak
 e a movie based on that theme. Filmmakers have been taking up the challenge
  since 2009\, and there have been over 900 short films made! <br>We will be
  curating a 45 minute\, “best of” program to showcase some of the amazing f
 ilms that have been made over the years. This month theme is: "INSTANT GRAT
 IFICATION" and filmmakers will be working on new films to be screened that 
 night\, which will be screened before the "Best Of" program.<br><br>This al
 l takes place at 9pm\, following the 4th and Rogers Block Party. Our screen
 ing will be inside the I Fell Gallery.<br><br>DURING THE BLOCK PARTY we wil
 l be screening the "best of" program on a loop inside Ardent Instruments (2
  doors down from Rainbow). <br><br>STILL TIME TO MAKE A MOVIE! If you have 
 ever made a movie for the challenge\, or have wanted to\, this is a good ti
 me to do it! We are so very proud of all the filmmakers and films that have
  been made in the past decade. Of course\, the best way to celebrate is to 
 make more movies! <br><br>If you've never been to a screening\, this is a p
 erfect introduction.&nbsp\;<br><br><a href="http://monthlymoviechallenge.co
 m" id="ow390" __is_owner="true">http://monthlymoviechallenge.com</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20190526T202851Z
LOCATION:I Fell Building
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Screening: Best of the Instant Gratification Film Challenge 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
