DESCRIPTION:Tune-Yards (from Vermont)\,\nPrayer Breakfast (members of Husba
 nd&Wife\, Vollmar\, Rapider Than Horsepower\, Everybody\, etc.)\,\nBen & Kr
 istin (Fowler and Emery)\,\nPaul Revere (Matt Nowlin's new band)\n<Br><Br>\
 n@ The Pourhouse Cafe\nWednesday September 24\n8pm\nonly $4\nALL AGES!\n<br
 ><br>\nTUNE-YARDS\nhttp://www.myspace.com/merrillgarbus\nYou seriously do n
 ot want to miss this amazing band (or maybe just solo musician?) from Vermo
 nt. Take a listen on the myspace. Seriously\, this shit is awesome\, and it
  is going to be super hip any minute now so this is your chance to see her/
 them in an intimate setting for a low price. And then you can tell all your
  hip friends that you are hipper than them because you saw her before she w
 as cool. Or you can forget about social absurdities and just come and enjoy
  the good music because you like it.\n<Br><Br>\nPrayer Breakfast\nhttp://ww
 w.myspace.com/prayerbreakfast\nDon't you know? I know you know. Don't you?\
 n\nPaul Revere\nAll I know is that this band includes Matt Nowlin (Nowlin-M
 ulholland Quintet\, Rusty Zavitson) and Anson Hohne (Nowlin-Mulholland Quin
 tet\, Resting Rooster)\, and consequently\, they will have an awesome live 
 show.\n<Br><Br>\nBen & Kristin\nYou know Ben and you have seen and heard hi
 m playing drums for the likes of The Delicious and Kentucky Nightmare. You 
 have seen Kristin selling beads and stones on Kirkwood and selling deliciou
 s baked goods at the Saturday morning farmer's market. Now you should see t
 hem on stage together\, plucking and picking and grinning and stomping and 
 singing.\n<br><br>\n\nAwesome. I am sincerely excited about this show. I me
 an\, seriously\, I am not even technically working for this show and I am m
 aking a silly facebook event so that you all might come and see some great 
 new music. This should be amongst your priority shows-to-see of the month\,
  if not the year.\n\n<br><Br>\nwww.spiritof68promotions.com 
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T050657Z
LOCATION:The Pourhouse Cafe 
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:TUNE-YARDS\, Prayer Breakfast\, and Ben & Kristin
TRANSP:OPAQUE
