DESCRIPTION:This is the ninth year that I have thrown this party. It starte
 d out as an excuse to show off some of the ridiculous Halloween props that 
 I have made and purchased in a party atmosphere. At first I only invited fr
 iends that I had acquired over my lifetime. I have been involved with all k
 inds of different people that would usually have nothing to do with one ano
 ther. It was kind of an experiment to see how they would all react to the m
 usic and each other. It turned out great\, the word about the party spread 
 and people started bringing their friends and now it has turned into a mass
 ive event.\nThis year\, we have the best bands in Bloomington on the bill a
 nd a couple of the most entertaining bands in the country playing along. Th
 e entry fee is as cheap as you could hope\, considering the huge lineup. Th
 is should be a reminder of how great the music scene really is here in Bloo
 mington and give us a chance to party with all of band members. So lets dre
 ss crazy\, act a fool and get our Rock N Roll Faces on\, because it is TigF
 est time MotherFu@&ers!!!! Metal in the Microwave\, Medusa Hail Architeuthi
 s!\, State\, Applecore\, Heypenny\, Prizzy Prizzy Please and more to come.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T050840Z
LOCATION:Uncle Fester's
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:TigFest 2009
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
