DESCRIPTION:From the website:<br>&quot\;Before AMERICAN IDOL\, there was ST
 AIRWAY TO STARDOM—a 1980s public access show from New York City that felt l
 ike it was broadcast from a TV station in TWIN PEAKS. From homemade R&amp\;
 B party hits to aggro stand-up comics\, from interpretive dance by zombifie
 d children to amateur magicians\, STAIRWAY TO STARDOM is an unending treasu
 re trove of bizarro entertainment that has been a staple among tape traders
  for decades. The AGFA team has compiled our favorite moments and performan
 ces from this charming\, otherworldly show to bring you THE STAIRWAY TO STA
 RDOM MIXTAPE—the definitive way to experience this fascinating\, hilarious\
 , and unforgettable cultural snapshot.&quot\;<br><a href="https://www.googl
 e.com/url?q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3DDkN-Ex_qXO0&amp\;sa=D&amp\;so
 urce=calendar&amp\;usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw1vzi-47F2mux8i7BG-Am4o" target="_bl
 ank">Trailer</a><br><br>7:30 and 10:pm. $5 18+<br><a href="https://www.goog
 le.com/url?q=https://cicadacinema.com/&amp\;sa=D&amp\;source=calendar&amp\;
 usd=2&amp\;usg=AOvVaw03H0-EFc3s9gIMAOEue-5e" target="_blank">Event page</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230128T165705Z
LOCATION:The Orbit Room
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Cicada Cinema: Stairway to Stardom Mixtape (2022) 18+
TRANSP:OPAQUE
