 elease\, at Cicada Cinema ONLY!<br><br>This will be an outdoor screening in
  the parking lot of Secretly Group 213 S. Rogers\, so bring your own comfy 
 chair\, if you have one. <br><br>Date: Wednesday\, October 9th<br>Location:
