DESCRIPTION:JEREMY JAY\nw/Sriracha Shits\n@ Bear's Place\nSunday May 3\n9pm
 \n$6\n21+\n\nJeremy Jay\nwww.myspace.com/jeremyjay\n--------------\n\nJerem
 y Jay lives in Angel town. He writes songs and plays piano and guitar. He s
 ays one of his favorite things to do is drive around with the moonroof open
  and listen to music with his friends.\nJeremy has gone on a couple west co
 ast tours and has played with a variety of bands. His performances on the s
 urface seem like a pop singer’s performance: dancing\, singing and playing 
 guitar. Yet he’s still so elusive. Like if you would reach out to grab him 
 you wouldn’t touch anything\, like all you see is a character from the Drea
 m world. Like Buddy Holly\, Peter Pan and John Hughes movies rolled into on
 e. He’s pure Storybook.
