 aws 19. Turnin’ it up really loud 20. Paint mares 21. Hot tubs 22. Porn 23.
  Cookouts 24. Camping 25. Fridays\, Saturdays\, and Sundays Turbo Fruits ha
 ve toured with Monotonix\, The Black Lips and The Lovvers. Their 2nd album\
