DESCRIPTION:Chapel Perilous returns with our always anticipated yearly bash
 :  Zombie Prom!\n\nMonday night\, October 25th\n9pm-2am\n21+ only please\n\
 n$3 cover\, $2 in costume\n\nSouthern Indiana's longest running dark altern
 ative dance night returns to bring you some of the best in Gothic\, Industr
 ial\, EBM\, Synth-pop\, New Wave\, House\, and more!\n\nWe'll have a great 
 assortment of regional DJs\, drink specials all night\, and as always\, our
  midnight costume contest.\n\nGet your costume on early\, bring your friend
 s\, and enjoy a great night out with Chapel Perilous\n\nOur friends from In
 dy have been wonderful enough to return and help us keep you out on the flo
 or!\n\nDJ's Gir\, Jin-XS\, and MicroMachine will all be down to help reside
 nts Lothair and Aleph keep the music going all night!\n\nWe will have some 
 drink specials in place just for us\, and the staff and Jake's is very exci
 ted to have us back... and we don't have to share the club with any other e
 vents (that went poorly last time!).\n\nSpread the word and tell your frien
 ds\, we'd love to have a good return to Bloomington after our long break\, 
 and the more of you that come out\, the more often we will try and bring Ch
 apel back to you!\n\njust remember:\n\nyou.will.dance.\n\nhttp://www.facebo
 ok.com/event.php?eid=121194064605488
