 rom eachother. You may lift your hatch or sit in back of trucks. If hatch i
 s open as always we ask you to tie the hatch so that it is even with the ro
 of of your vehicle so that fellow patrons behind you can see the screen. Yo
 u can not sit in chairs beside your vehicle\, but you can sit in front of i
 t. <br>Restrooms will be limited to 2 at a time and will be sanitized every
  15 minutes. <br>Our concession stand will be open. We will have markings o
 n our floor encouraging a safe distance of 6 feet between groups. Our staff
  will wear masks. Anytime you visit the restrooms or concession stands we a
 sk that you do the same. <br>Drink and Popcorn refills will now be offered 
 at .50 each at this time. We will have to provide a new Cup\, Bag or Tub an
 d will have to have original item returned to concession stand for disposal
 . <br>Let's all work together to make sure that we can remain open and enjo
