DESCRIPTION:From the website<br>Part documentary\, part rock film\, and all
  kinds of crazy. Stunt Rock is a musical-mockumentary-stunt-spectacular sta
 rring real-life stuntman Grant Page as himself as well as the real-life ban
 d Sorcery\, helping them develop pyrotechnic magic tricks for their stage s
 hows which includes The Prince of Darkness locked in cosmic combat with the
  King of the Wizards. All while finding himself in a budding romance with r
 eporter Lois Wills. <br><br>The beautifully titled Stunt Rock was heavily f
 eatured in the documentary Not Quite Hollywood: The Wild and Untold Story o
 f Ozploitation!\, that chronicled the rise of the Aussie specific subgenre 
 of exploitation film that birthed the careers of world renown directors suc
 h as Peter Weir and George Miller.<br>&nbsp\;<br>8:pm $7 21+<br><a href="ht
 tps://cicadacinema.com/products/stunt-rock-september-2-8pm-blockhouse-bar" 
 id="ow399" __is_owner="true">Event Page</a>
