CREATED:20191203T210206Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><span>On December 6th\, Extinction Rebellion Bloomington wi
 ll participate in the international day of climate action by taking over ci
 ty hall and transforming it into a festival for our collective future. We w
 ill learn together\, participating in teach-ins that address the ways in wh
 ich the climate crisis disproportionately affects those of us who are alrea
 dy the most poor or marginalized due to race\, gender\, sexuality\, or abil
 ity. We will act together\, contacting and engaging our elected officials a
 t all levels of government. We will create together\, making signs and craf
 ts that express what climate justice means to us. We will share together in
  music\, poetry\, and art. We will stand up to the mayor\, demanding that h
 e declare a city wide climate emergency\, and take radical action that is p
 roportional to the enormity of the climate crisis. <br></span><br><span><br
 ></span><br><span>Together we will boldly stand in opposition to the powers
  that continue to lead our planet on a path to destruction. Together\, we w
 ill joyously affirm and share together in the hope for our collective futur
 e.</span><br><span></span><span><br>Schedule:<br><br>1:00 walk-out of schoo
 l/work<br>2:00 festival at city hall<br>3:30 rally and presentation of dema
 nds to the Mayor</span><br><span><br></span><br><span>1pm All Ages</span><b
 r><span><a href="https://www.facebook.com/events/962591840770105/">FB event
 </a><br></span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20191203T210222Z
LOCATION:Bloomington City Hall
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Climate Strike: Sit-In City Hall
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
