DESCRIPTION:Ben Kweller covers a wide variety of genres in his music\, incl
 uding punk rock\, folk\, and indie-pop. He's been on the road as a solo art
 ist since 2001\, and has played with many reputable names\, such as Guster\
 , Jeff Tweedy and Death Cab for Cutie. His debut and breakthrough album\, S
 ha Sha\, includes hit singles "Wasted and Ready" and "Commerce\, TX." This 
 tour is to support his newest album\, Changing Horses.\n<br><Br>\nThe Watso
 n Twins received national recognition in 2006 in their collaboration with J
 enny Lewis of Rilo Kiley on Rabbit Fur Coat. Their music is a mix of indie-
 rock\, folk\, and alternative-country. This tour is in support of their ful
 l length debut\, Fire Songs.\n<br><br>\nTickets may be purchased at the fol
 lowing website:\nhttp://www.bloomingtonarts.info/Public/Calendar/performanc
 e.asp?PerfID=23240
