  transplanted into an ancient animatronic predator. Don't miss this redisco
 vered cult classic that needs to be seen to be believed. Originally filmed 
 as a gorefest w/ impressive splatter by SFX guru John Carl Buechler\, TAMMY
 ’s only minimal release back in the day was cut to PG-13\, funneled straigh
