 ect the correct date for your visit and that you enter your email address c
 orrectly. You will not receive a confirmation if anything is misspelled.**<
 br><br>With over 7 acres we have plenty of room to social distance. Purchas
 ing tickets online DOES guarantee a spot\, but you will want to arrive earl
