 ou can not sit in chairs beside your vehicle\, but you can sit in front of 
 it. <br>Restrooms will be limited to 2 at a time and will be sanitized ever
 y 15 minutes. <br>Our concession stand will be open. We will have markings 
 on our floor encouraging a safe distance of 6 feet between groups. Our staf
 f will wear masks. Anytime you visit the restrooms or concession stands we 
 ask that you do the same. <br>Drink and Popcorn refills will now be offered
