DTSTART:20100217T020000Z
DTEND:20100217T050000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041548Z
UID:amh84s6u47tlps8f8hgpk7us0c@google.com
CREATED:20100118T175214Z
DESCRIPTION:DRAKKAR SAUNA\nw/ The Hollows\nat Russian Recording\nTuesday Fe
 bruary 16\n9pm\n$8\nall ages\n\nIf not the first\, then surely the most com
 mon question we are asked is how we came to name ourselves Drakkar Sauna. W
 e want to tell you. We want you to know\, if only so that you’ll stop askin
 g. It makes us feel vulnerable\, it makes us feel judged.\n\nWe thought it 
 sounded like a palindrome. What it comes down to is we didn’t have any scra
 tch paper handy and our understanding of what a palindrome is wasn’t accura
 te. But that’s what happened. ‘Drakkar’sounded like a palindrome. So did ‘S
 auna’. We thought that two palindromes would make one bigger palindrome. Ob
 viously\, we were\, in part\, mistaken. I hope now your curiosity is satisf
 ied and you will not think too poorly of us for our incomplete command of t
 he language.\n\nWe live in Lawrence\, Kansas and are fathers to three full-
 length recordings\, Rover\, Drakkansasauna\, & Jabraham Lincoln.\n\nWe have
  recorded\, also\, an ep\, Hunger Overcame Us and helped produce a feature 
 video\, “The Blood Feud\,” a work of fiction. We are\, in all things\, supp
 orted by our union with Marriage Records. We have toured the U.S.A. a few t
 imes. We have toured with Dark Meat and the Vomit Lazers Family Galaxy\, Sp
 lit Lip Rayfield\, The Impossible Shapes\, Two Gallants\, Magnolia Electric
  Company and by ourselves.\n\nOur names are Jeff Stolz and Wallace Cochran 
 and we get along well.\n\nwww.myspace.com/drakkansasauna\nwww.myspace.com/t
 hehollowshome
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T050855Z
LOCATION:Russian Recording
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:DRAKKAR SAUNA
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
