DESCRIPTION:From the website:<br>"Before AMERICAN IDOL\, there was STAIRWAY
  TO STARDOM—a 1980s public access show from New York City that felt like it
  was broadcast from a TV station in TWIN PEAKS. From homemade R&amp\;B part
 y hits to aggro stand-up comics\, from interpretive dance by zombified chil
 dren to amateur magicians\, STAIRWAY TO STARDOM is an unending treasure tro
 ve of bizarro entertainment that has been a staple among tape traders for d
 ecades. The AGFA team has compiled our favorite moments and performances fr
 om this charming\, otherworldly show to bring you THE STAIRWAY TO STARDOM M
 IXTAPE—the definitive way to experience this fascinating\, hilarious\, and 
 unforgettable cultural snapshot."<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch
 ?v=DkN-Ex_qXO0">Trailer</a><br><br>7:30 and 10:pm. $5 18+<br><a href="https
 ://cicadacinema.com/">Event page</a>
