DESCRIPTION:$15 Adult\, $10 Youth\, $20 at door. Available at the BCT Box O
 ffice\n\nAn all-ages interactive fashion show and fund raiser for the Cente
 r for Sustainable Living. With designs made from recycled elements and re-s
 tyled used clothing.\n\nGuests will have ample time between two 20 minute r
 unway shows to peruse items in our silent auction also made from recycled i
 tems\, purchase drinks and participate in an interactive Trashion piece.\n\
 nThis event is part of the 26th annual Bloomington ArtsWeek: http://artswee
 k.indiana.edu/\nand is being organized by the Center for Sustainable Living
 . All proceeds will benefit this non-profit\, community organization: http:
 //simplycsl.org\n\nTo find out more information and purchase tickets\, visi
 t our website at: http://bloomingtontrashion.org\nFor other communications\
 , email us at: bloomingtontrashion@gmail.com
