 roud to co-sponsor the Art of Chocolate\, benefiting Options\, a local non-
 profit organization that partners with people who have disabilities to buil
 d inclusive communities. Local and regional chefs will offer decadent choco
 late creations and delicious appetizers for guests in the museum’s soaring 
 atrium\; music\, gallery browsing\, and wine tasting will also be offered. 
 A silent auction with all proceeds benefiting Options will take place throu
 ghout the evening. Tickets: $40 each—call Options\, 1-800-875-9615. More in
 formation: www.weekofchocolate.com. 
