DESCRIPTION:BCS will be hosting a one-day public workshop with Jay Strommen
 \, a talented multi-media artist from Chicago. Strommen is currently an ind
 ependent studio artist and ceramics instructor at the LillStreet Art Center
 . He received his MFA in 2000 from the School of the Art Institute of Chica
 go and his BFA from the University of South Florida. After his formal educa
 tion\, Strommen was a Artist-in-Residence at the Shigaraki Ceramic Cultural
  Park in Japan. On view now through March 12 is a solo exhibition of his wo
 rks at Perimeter Gallery in Chicago. To see more of Strommen's works go to:
  www.jaystrommen.com. For more information about the free 1-day workshop\, 
 contact: bloomingtonclaystudio@gmail.com
