DESCRIPTION:BOTTOMLESS PIT\nw/ Waxeater\n@ Bears Place\nWed May 13\n9pm\n$8
 \n21+\n\nBottomless Pit\nwww.myspace.com/bottomlesspitchicago\n------------
 --\nBottomless Pit was formed in the fall of 2005 by erstwhile Silkworm mem
 bers Tim Midgett and Andy Cohen. Their longtime friends Chris Manfrin (Seam
 ) and Brian Orchard (.22) complete the quartet. 2007 finds the group playin
 g “their blues” - soulful\, emotionally intense\, and often transcendent po
 stpunk that is as inviting as it is bracing. “Hammer of the Gods” is the fi
 rst Bottomless Pit album. It is the first release from New Jersey’s Comedy 
 Minus One records. It was released November 6\, 2007.\n\nWaxeater\nwww.mysp
 ace.com/waxeatermusic
