DESCRIPTION:New Work by Phillip Lynam and Jeremy Brightbill\n\nAbstracted I
 nteractions explores two Indiana\nartists’ approach to color\, emotion and 
 process in\na one-night pairing. Through subtle shifts of color\nand mutabl
 e sequences of form\, each artist\nexpresses visions that are both lucid ye
 t scripted\,\nexplosive and contained. Separately they offer\nunique atmosp
 heric statements\; together they\ntease the tensions between the sublimity 
 of\ncontrol and abandon.
