 cuses on providing bike transportation to the people of the city. We focus 
 on teaching bicycle maintenence in order to ensure that bikes on the street
 s stay on the streets. Here is what we do: Community Bike Project Front Doo
 r<br><br><br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;* bikes for sale: we sell gently used b
 ikes at bargain prices<br><br><br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;* earn-a-bike
  program: participants can receive a bicycle after volunteering their time 
 in our shop<br><br><br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;* advocacy: we support a
 lternative forms of transportation\; we support the reuse and recycling of 
 bicycles<br><br><br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;* workshops &amp\; classes:
  we offer unique bike maintence workshops and classes for children and adul
 ts<br><br><br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;* open shop: we make our tools av
 ailable to the public<br><br><br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/btownbik
 eproject/" id="ow664" __is_owner="true">FB PAGE</a>
