DESCRIPTION:Come for an hour or stay all day\, either way\, we could use yo
 ur help. No special skills necessary.\n\nJoin us as we work to finish a cob
  composting outhouse\, start a cob chicken coup\, put up fencing for a chic
 ken yard\, and more!\n\nIn addition to helping build and dig and play in di
 rt\, there will be food (maybe treats from the vegan bake easy) and possibl
 y an evening with a bonfire\, games and an outdoor movie.\n\nYou can also m
 eet and cuddle with all the critters that currently reside at the sanctuary
  (17 cats\, 2 dogs\, a rabbit\, a turtle\, a chicken and a duck). You don't
  have to spend the whole time working\, either. Feel free to go for a hike 
 through the 100s of acres of forest or take a dip in the lake or go for a c
 anoe ride.\n\nDonations are always welcome\, but not necessary. The days bu
 ilding costs are estimated to be a couple hundred dollars. So every bit hel
 ps!\n\nThanks! Look forward to seeing yall there.\n\nOh\, if you need a rid
 e\, let us know by contacting chris at the email or phone above. Or ask for
  one in the comments and we'll see what we can do.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T051446Z
LOCATION: Deep Roots Animal Sanctuary\,  1214 Rattlesnake Road\, Spencer\, 
 IN
