DESCRIPTION:This month\, WFHB's Local Live from Russian Recording features 
 West African tribal fusion and Brazialian reggae. The broadcast opens with 
 a set from Iuri Santos and the Saints - Indiana-based\, internationally-bor
 n originators of a unique blending of Brazillian roots reggae with jazz\, f
 unk\, blues and hip-hop. The second set features West African tribal fusion
  with Dr. Djo Bi and Asafo - rhythms of the Ivory Coast fused with traditio
 nal western instruments. Dr. Djo Bi is a West African (Cote de Ivory) drum 
 master.\nJoin us at Russian Recording for this exciting show. $5 cover\, be
 er available. Listen to the live broadcast at 91.3/98.1/106/3/100.7 FM in s
 outh central Indiana. Find our live stream: at http://www.wfhb.org
