DESCRIPTION:Bloomington's newest institution.\n\nSEE!! Crazy films from the
  50's\, 60's & 70's\n\nHEAR!! Obscurities\, novelties\, and classics from t
 he 1950s to the present - garage\, girl groups\, beat\, glam\, punk\, bubbl
 egum\, rockabilly\, & liberal doses of new wave\, all mixed at a steady cli
 p for your drinking and dancing pleasure.\n\nTASTE!! Ice cold beer!! Stiff 
 mixed drinks!!\nAll served up by superstar bartender Josh Johnson in the ch
 arming confines of Bloomington's only punk rock & roll bar (and it's air co
 nditioned)!\n\nALSO\, don't miss the free stuff!!\n...Fresh goods available
