DESCRIPTION:Decarcerate Monroe County (DMC) is pleased to invite you to com
 e celebrate with us the defeat of a jail by our local community!\n\nOver th
 e past two years we have come out in opposition to the construction of a ne
 w jail in our community\, as well as opposition to the increased use of cag
 es and punishment as a solution to complex socio-economic problems.\n\nNow 
 that the dust has settled\, for the moment\, we’d like to take this opportu
 nity to celebrate our shared victory with the community.\n\nThere will sing
 ing\, dancing\, and Rachael has been gracious enough to pledge 10% of all d
 rinking sales to DMC. 
