DESCRIPTION:Please join us for the last Fuller event of spring 2009:\n\nKei
 ra Norton - Third Wave Encantadas:\nA winsome\, yet sexy feminist commentar
 y\, starring...dolphins!\n\nEmily Barthel - What started as a simple collag
 e experiment\, resulted in an entire body of work filled with whimsy and hu
 mor brought to you by brutal juxtaposition utilizing two opposite ends of t
 he spectrum\, children’s activity books and adult magazines.\n\nMaria do Ca
 rmo Freitas - ARCHIVES OF THE MEMORY: STORIES OF A HOUSE\nMaria do Carmo Fr
 eitas is a Brazilian artist\, scholar and professor and her work is focused
  on printmaking and the relationships between word and image\, dealing with
  memory archives. In this exhibition she will present two recent series of 
 digital prints where she incorporates photos exploring different aspects of
  the city of Bloomington and its houses.
