 om for everyone! Friday\, February 5\, 8–11pm.\n\nEnjoy a variety of free c
 hocolate treats as you dance the night away to sweet music. Including live 
 performances by Community Currency (featuring the Romy brothers)\, Xenosoun
 d (a Rhino's favorite)\, and Among the Sky (featuring Cristiaan Amari). So 
 put on your fanciest threads\, grab your sweetheart\, invite all your frien
 ds\, and come to prom! (Formal dress is optional.)\n\nAdmission at the door
  will be $10 per person or $15 for a couple. But advance tickets are only $
 5! Tickets are available at Rhino's\, the BCT box office\, or online at www
 .rhinosyouthcenter.org\n\nRhino's Chocolate Prom is a fundraiser for Rhino'
 s Youth Center. All proceeds will benefit Rhino's afterschool programs. Pre
 sented as part of the Week of Chocolate.
