DESCRIPTION: The Community Bike Project is a Bloomington-based organization
  that focuses on providing bike transportation to the people of the city. W
 e focus on teaching bicycle maintenence in order to ensure that bikes on th
 e streets stay on the streets. Here is what we do: Community Bike Project F
 ront Door\n<br><br>\n    * bikes for sale: we sell gently used bikes at bar
 gain prices<Br>\n    * earn-a-bike program: participants can receive a bicy
 cle after volunteering their time in our shop<Br>\n    * advocacy: we suppo
 rt alternative forms of transportation\; we support the reuse and recycling
  of bicycles<Br>\n    * workshops & classes: we offer unique bike maintence
  workshops and classes for children and adults<Br>\n    * open shop: we mak
 e our tools available to the public\n
