 s debut appearance in Bloomington on Saturday\, January 24th along with Blo
 omington's own Everybody and the return of Metavari from Fort Wayne.\n<br><
 br>\n(from Ghostly International) "When Randolph Chabot first began recordi
 ng his own albums at age 12\, he discovered a means of living out his fanta
 sies. Using whatever instrument he could find\, Chabot began constructing h
 yper-emotional dream worlds—teenage symphonies peopled by superheroes\, ali
 ens\, lost souls\, and star-crossed lovers. He’s been zipping through the c
 louds ever since\, streaking the skies as his superhuman alter-ego\, Deastr
 o."\n<br><br>\nRead more about Deastro here - http://ghostly.com/artists/de
 astro\n<br><br>\nListen to Deastro here - http://www.myspace.com/deastro\n<
 br><Br>\nRead Randolph's blog here - http://deastroband.blogspot.com\n<Br><
 br>\n--------------------------------------\n\nEverybody -<br>\nhttp://www.
 tagteamrecords.com<Br>\nhttp://www.myspace.com/everybodylistens<br>\n<Br>\n
 Metavari <Br>- http://www.mtvri.com<br>\nhttp://www.myspace.com/metavari\n<
 Br><br>\n
