  dudes)\n\nFreddie T and the People\n(fronted by Fred Erskin from June of 4
 4 and Hoover\, featuring members of Medusa and Racebannon)\n\nThis show/eve
 nt is open to the public\, and will be broadcast live on WFHB. Bring your f
 riends\, your friend's friends and their friends too.\n\nDecember's edition
  of Local Live from Russian Recording is also a birthday party for my roomm
 ate and good friend Mike A. This is the actual date of his 31st birthday\, 
