DESCRIPTION:The School of Fine Arts (SoFA) Gallery at Indiana University is
  pleased to announce upcoming student exhibits\, which will feature artwork
 s created by IU Fine Arts students in Sculpture\, Photography\, Digital Art
  (DART) & Printmaking Area programs. An Opening Reception will accompany ea
 ch exhibit\, from 7:00 – 9:00 pm on Friday\, January 29 Students help plan 
 the exhibits and install their artworks.\n\nBachelor of Fine Arts and Maste
 r of Fine Arts students in the Sculpture\, Photography\, Printmaking\, and 
 Digital Art (DART) will present their artworks\, January 26 – February 6\, 
 2010. Artworks in display will include works artworks utilizing non-traditi
 onal styles and techniques\, internet-based work\, video art\, flash-based 
 animation\, contemporary photographs\, and works that explore the uses of n
 ew media. An Opening Reception for the exhibit will be held on Friday\, Jan
 uary 29\, from 7:00 – 9:00 pm.
