DTEND:20081213T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041548Z
UID:qkqlbc4dds63e488uhtnkbtl7s@google.com
CREATED:20081126T142956Z
DESCRIPTION:Songs for a New World\, one of Jason Robert Brown's most moving
  and inspiring works\, is a revue that touches upon making choices\, taking
  stands\, and looking both back and forward to a world full of risk\, happi
 ness\, and uncertainty. With a stimulating blend of contemporary music and 
 a connection of a single theme\, this show is about the stories and people 
 of today\, and the songs for the future....\n\nTickets are available at the
  door and will be available on www.bloomingtonarts.info on Thursday\, Novem
 ber 20th.  Tickets will be $10 general\, $7 student\, and $5 for senior/chi
 ld.
