DESCRIPTION:Spirit of ’68 Promotions is pleased to announce that These Are 
 Powers\, Dylan Ettinger\, and Morrow will be performing at Bear’s Place on 
 September 12\, 2008. The show will begin at 10 p.m. showcasing a variety of
  dynamic sounds\, diverse backgrounds and the collaboration of genres from 
 traditional Mexican influences to new age punk\, electronica and beatbox\, 
 creating a show like you’ve never seen. This concert will cost $5 at the do
 or and is 21+.\n<br><br>\nThese Are Powers\nhttp://thesearepowers.com\nStra
 ight out of New York\, These Are Powers give electronica a new edge. With a
  mixture of tribal beats\, entrancing lyrics\, and the occasional addition 
 of beat box\, These Are Powers have modernized a genre once associated with
  neon mesh tank tops and glow sticks and have created a sound they describe
  as “healing and easy listening.” This experimental yet playful sound comes
  the artistic minds of Anna Barrie\, Pat Noecker\, and Bill Salas\, allowin
 g this rare collision of genres to explode on to the Bloomington stage.\n(D
 ead Oceans Records)\nContact- John Chavez- johnchaves@groundcontroltouring.
 com\n<br><br>\nDylan Ettinger\nhttp://www.myspace.com/dylanettinger\nIf you
  dig creative\, psychedelic sounds\, Dylan Ettinger is a must see. A Bloomi
 ngton native\, Ettinger combines trippy tribal beats and ancient Mexican cu
 lture to create an euphoric and enlightening sound\, worlds apart from the 
 “hip” and “groovy” tunes of our parent’s generation. This new wave sound wi
 ll ease and relax the senses\, allowing the mind to travel\, explore\, and 
 experience an old genre in a new way.\n<br><br>\nMorrow\nhttp://www.myspace
 .com/weatherprophets\nWith raging guitar solos and wild yet melodic vocals\
 , local rock band Morrow combines intricate rhythms with intense lyrics res
 ulting in rock music with an artistic edge. Morrow experiments with differe
 nt sounds such as violin\, giving this rock band a hard rough exterior with
  a soulful undertone. Powerful vocals and strong energetic drums\, make Mor
 row a band definitely worth seeing.\n\n<br><br>\nFor more information\, che
 ck out http://www.spiritof68promotions.com
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T051725Z
LOCATION:Bear's Place
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:These Are Powers\, Morrow\, & Dylan Ettinge
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
