CREATED:20100121T052020Z
DESCRIPTION:Holy shit! It's birthday time again. If you've missed the past 
 two years of super birthday party skate fest extravaganza\, well\, you miss
 ed it. But don't cry\, now is your chance!\n\nCome celebrate 30 years of Ch
 ris ("Lord Seitan") and 28 years of Melissa ("Unicoroner") with roller skat
 ing\, live bands\, jam skating\, sugar highs\, and butt bruises.\n\nAs usua
 l\, there will be bands playing in the middle of the rink. This year we hav
 e Slamdunk\, Gourmet Scum\, and a yet to be determined band (because there 
 are too many great choices for us to narrow it down to one).\n\nAgain\, we 
 encourage folks to bring vegan food\, especially things that will give us a
  sugar rush.\n\nWe may have special guests Jamasaurus Rox out on the floor 
 teaching folks jam skating 101.\n\nWe'll be putting together another great 
 dance mix to play between bands (cuz you gotta have music to skate to). If 
 you have ANY suggestions\, just let us know in the comments section. We are
  going to do our best to add all requests to the mix.\n\nIf you don't want 
 to skate\, no worries. There are always lots of folks just hanging out. If 
 you don't know how to skate or haven't skated in awhile\, there is always a
 t least one person who learns to skate at our party each year. We love to s
 pread the addition of quad skating.\n\nThere is a $5 cover charge. That wil
 l cover your skate rental and three hours of fun. On top of that\, we are a
 lso paying $225 to rent the space. So any donations will be GREATLY appreci
