DESCRIPTION:SOUL IN THE HOLE vs NO! MTV RAPS\n6 DJ\, all vinyl\, DJ battle 
 royale\n@ The Video Saloon\nFriday June 12\n9pm\n$3\n\nBringing together Bl
 oomington's old school DJ crews in an all vinyl soundclash of beats\, break
 s\, and crate digging skills.\n\nIn one corner we have the Soul In The Hole
  DJs:\n\nJUNEBUG + WHITE LIGHT WHITE HEATH + JONNY YUMA -\n\nA reverse soul
 eo cookie of vinyl junkies bringing 45 and LP funk goodness. Soul\, funk\, 
 disco\, r&b\, jook joint heaters and dancefloor fillers that have been sett
 ing backfields in motion for decades.\n\nIn the other corner we have the No
 ! MTV Raps DJs with special guest DJ Spikes:\n\nWALLY WONDER + THE COUNTS O
 F BOUNCE + SPIKES -\n\nBorn in the era of shell toes and high top fades\, s
 chooled in the era of Native Tongues and New Jack Swing\, they bring the ol
 d school hip-hop fire that rocked blacktops and middle school mixers from t
 he Boogie Down Brooklyn to the Bloomington streets that gave Booker T his s
 oul education. Stepping away from their laptops and back into their crates\
 , this will be a dance party for the ages
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T051459Z
