DESCRIPTION:A film by one of the prominent directors of the Czech New Wave 
 cinema according to the novel by Vladimír Körner. In the aftermath of World
  War II\, a former Czech soldier takes charge of a manor formerly owned by 
 a German family. He falls in love with the daughter\, who is now a maid\, a
 nd is forced to confront the dilemma between his love and his conscience wh
 en he discovers her sheltering her German-soldier brother. Color\, 99 minut
 es. Introduced by Professor Bronislava Volková \n<br><Br>\nFREE
