UID:792390ire2cnl0hdu86h322mac@google.com
CREATED:20081107T172041Z
DESCRIPTION:Spirit of '68 Presents...\n<br><br>\nAA BONDY<Br>\nDAVE DAVISON
  (Maps & Atlases)<Br>\n@ Bear's Place<Br>\nWednesday November 12th\n10pm\n$
 7\n21+\n<br><br>\nAA Bondy\nwww.myspace.com/aabondy\n=================\nCom
 ing from Birmingham\, Alabama. Ex-Verbena frontman toned down his sound in 
 recent years after Verbena disbanded.\nThe guitars may be mostly acoustic t
 hese days\, but the southern drawl and honest lyric and songwriting style s
 till shine through. It seems Bondy has found another perfect style for his 
 raspy voice\, the acoustic blues akin to Rolling Stones ballads or Bob Dyla
 n.\n<br><br>\nDave Davison\nwww.myspace.com/mapsandatlases\n===============
 =======\nMaps and Atlases offer songs that wrestle themselves from flailing
 \, algebraic fits of spazzy guitar notes and drum ruptures to lulling\, voi
 ce-driven melodies that speak stories using lyrical images strung together 
 like soup cans chasing a Cadillac. Mostly influenced by experimental and te
 chnically adept musicians such as Hella\, Don Caballero\, and Psych-Folkies
  Devendra Banhart and Six Organs of Admittance\, Maps and Atlases create a 
 distinctive blend of the intricate and organic.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T051357Z
LOCATION:Bear's Place
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:AA Bondy\, Dave Davison
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
