 ot Watson\n(Scrambled Legs DJs- Bloomington Indiana)\n\nAND VERY SPECIAL GU
 EST COMING FROM CHICAGO......\n\nVIP J\nTHE OFFICIAL DJ OF THE COOL KIDS!!!
 \n\nWhen people mention The Cool Kids\, they usually mention Mikey Rock and
  Chuck Inglish. But if the backbone of Hip Hop is the DJ\, then the backbon
 e of any group\, or at least an important component is the guy behind the d
