DESCRIPTION:If you haven't heard much about this from the previous two time
 s it was done\, "Band in a Hat" is a project where folks submit their names
  and contact info into a "hat" (box) and then names are randomly drawn back
  out again to form new bands of about 5 people. These bands then get togeth
 er\, make music\, and all perform at a big show together on the first weeke
 nd of December. The style\, content\, songs\, level of seriousness\, and ev
 erything else are up to you.\n\nIt is much fun for those participating and 
 spectating.\n\nBand in a Hat is not a competition\, and it is not necessary
  that you be a professional musician to sign up. A little bit o' skill is h
 elpful but a good attitude is even more so. The idea is just to play music 
 with new people and exercise a little creativity.\n\nTHIS YEAR THE "HAT" (B
 OX) FOR NAME SUBMISSION IS AT BOXCAR BOOKS -  W. 6th St. The box is on the 
 shelf when you first come in the door\, there are instructions and entry fo
 rms already there.\n\nOn the entry form we'll need your name\, email\, phon
 e #\, and the name of a cover song that you'd like to suggest a band to do.
 \n\nTHE DEADLINE TO SIGN UP IS HALLOWEEN\, BUT! There is also a cap of 40 p
 eople this year\, so please sign up early just in case it fills up.\n\nThe 
 show will be December3 or 4...The date and location are TBA but it will be 
 somewhere cool and the show will be FREE or very cheap.\n\n\n\n\nhttp://www
 .facebook.com/event.php?eid=136674839715717
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T051802Z
LOCATION:Boxcar Books & Community Center Inc
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Sign up for Band in a Hat!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
