DESCRIPTION:It has been 20 years since the publication "Queers Read This" i
 nspired a\nmovement of queers supporting and fighting for life\, stolen by 
 the aids\nepidemic. 3 years ago a group named Bash Back emerged out of the 
 failures\nof the gay and lesbian rights movement only to fall apart in the 
 3rd year\nof existence. The discussion being lead by the Queer Negation Tou
 r will be\nhow to keep the polemics' given to us by Bash Back and Act-Up al
 ive. And\nthe consequences of basing movements off of a potential Future.\n
 \n--Also\, it will maybe/probably be happening in conjunction with the mont
 hly Deep Roots potluck\, so if you can keep both on your calendar\, that wo
 uld be great! Thanks so much\,\n
