DESCRIPTION:THE LAST CINEMAT SHOW EVER!!! Come enjoy Bloomington's greatest
  concert venue one last time\, with the great Adrian Orange and Her Band!\n
 \nAdrian Orange and Her Band (K Records)\nFancie\nDang!Fever\n(D)(B)(H)\nMo
 nday May 18\n@ The Cinemat\n8pm\n$5\n\nAdrian Orange is the young (22 years
  young) songwriter who has put out an impressive amount of impressive and e
 njoyable musical recordings under the moniker Thanksgiving and under his ow
 n name.\n\nDiscography (oldest to newest):\n\nWe Could Be Each Other's Evid
 ence CD\, Vit! Vit! Records\, June 2002\nNothing CD\, Marriage Records\, Ja
 nuary 2003\nNow It Is All Over Like The Birds CDEP\, Marriage Records\, Jun
 e 2004\nThe Lake at Night b/w The "In the Lake" 7"\, Marriage Records\, Aug
 ust 2004\nWelcome Nowhere LP\, PW Elverum and Sun\, October 2004\nThe Ghost
  and the Eyes (with) Trees in the Ground Outside the Window CD-EP\, States 
 Rights Records/Slender Means Society Pregnancy Series #2 (actually a "doubl
 e EP")\, January 2005\nThe River by Thanksgiving CD\, Hive-Fi/Marriage Reco
 rds\, March 2005\n"The 'In The World'" or Six New Songs of Thanksgiving EP\
 , Marriage Records\, April 2005\nThanksgiving S/T 3xLP+CDR\, Marriage Recor
 ds/PW Elverum & Sun\, December 2005\nCave Days & Moments CD\, Marriage Reco
 rds\, February 2006\nBitches Is Lord CD and LP\, Marriage Records\, August 
 2006\nAdrian Orange and Her Band CD and LP\, K Records\, September 2007\n\n
 Adrian Orange and Her Band\nhttp://www.myspace.com/adrianorangeandherband\n
