DESCRIPTION:Join feminists around the country in celebrating the 36th anniv
 ersary of Roe v. Wade--the historic Supreme Court case which defines a woma
 n's right to choose whether to carry to term or terminate a pregnancy as pr
 otected by her right to privacy.\n<br><br>\nHelp collect signatures on post
 cards to state representatives in support of the Freedom of Choice Act whic
 h further protects a woman's right to choose. Send me a message to let me k
 now you would like to be a part of this initiative!\n<Br><br>\nCelebrate an
 d protect Roe.\n<BR><br>\nSupport women’s health care centers and abortion 
 services providers.\n<Br><br>\nContact your state representative and urge h
 er/him to support the Freedom of Choice Act.\n<Br><br>\nDemand reproductive
  justice now because its a woman's choice!
