DESCRIPTION:Low Hanging Fruit productions is pleased to announce\, The Elep
 hant 6 Holiday Surprise Tour and release of "Major Organ and the Adding Mac
 hine." This event will be occurring at the Cinemat (123 S. Walnut st) on We
 dnesday\, October 22 and is an all ages event. Tickets will go on sale Tomo
 rrow (Wednesday\, September 17) at the following locations: The Cinemat (12
 3 S Walnut)\, Landlocked Music (202 N Walnut)\, and TDs\, CDs and LPs (322 
 E. Kirkwood\, within the Soma/Laughing Planet building. Tickets are also av
 ailable online at the following url: http://www.bloomingtonarts.info/Public
 /Calendar/performance.asp?PerfID=22078\n<br><br>\nJulian Koster\, William C
 ullen Hart\, Scott Spillane\, Laura Carter\, Eric Harris\, Nesey Gallons an
 d many more will join together as a traveling variety show this October. Ju
 lian describes the evenings as "a big orchestra\, variety show\, silly happ
 y thing." The large gathering of Elephant 6 members will be playing the mus
 ic of The Music Tapes\, Neutral Milk Hotel\, Circulatory System\, Scott Spi
 llane\, Gerbils\, Elf Power\, Olivia Tremor Control\, Nana Grizol\, Nesey G
 allons and more...\nhttp://www.pitchforkmedia.com/article/news/146441-photo
 s-jeff-mangum-and-friends-new-york-ny-10-11-08\nhttp://www.pitchforkmedia.c
 om/article/news/146431-jeff-mangum-surfaces-at-elephant-6-show-in-nyc
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T051235Z
LOCATION:Rhino's
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Elephant 6 Holiday Surprise Show MOVED TO RHINOS
