DESCRIPTION:THE XX\nw/ JJ\nat The Buskirk Chumley Theater\nTuesday April 6\
 n8pm\n$13\n\nFormed in 2005\, The xx are a London trio\, featuring the dual
  lead vocals of Romy Madley Croft and Oliver Sim (who also play lead guitar
  and bass guitar respectively)\, and Jamie Smith (beats\, MPC sampler). Rou
 nding out the group was keyboardist Baria Qureshi.\n\nBonding over a shared
  love of dark\, emotive 80s guitar sounds and the high-end sheen of America
 n R&B\, The xx’s unique sound befits a band whose wide range of influences 
 combine via beautiful\, hushed vocal duets and a brilliantly inventive use 
 of samples and low-end frequencies to produce stark\, sweet melancholic pop
 .\n\nwww.myspace.com/thexx 
