DESCRIPTION:What happens when standard means of artistic production are bar
 red to the artist? What remains? What is gained or lost\, and what\, finall
 y\, is really important?\n\nSix MFA Sculpture students explore the challeng
 e of having unexpected obstructions placed in the path of their processes. 
 Each artist will show a pre-conceived work and its doppelganger as manifest
 ed through the five obstructions--be it simply altered\, improved or destro
 yed.\n\nObstructions will also extend to audience\, who will encounter thei
 r own unique demands on the viewing experience.\n\nFeaturing the work of: T
 errence Heldreth\, Payson McNett\, Matt Meers\, Sung-eun Park\, Marla Roddy
  and Xiaoou Sun\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T051311Z
LOCATION:McCalla School Building
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Art Opening: 5 Obstructions
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
