DESCRIPTION:Hard Candy Hearts - Applecore - Andy D\nSaturday January 30th\n
 10pm\n\nAre you tired of going to a show that sounds like a guy who has bee
 n breastfed till the age of 12 is playing a $20\,000 guitar with mittens on
  while the sound engineer squeezes his balls with one hand and cools them w
 ith a Chinese fan with the other? Then come out for this Saturday night spe
 cial with three local rock favorites that like to party.\n\nAndy D is like 
 a Baskin-Robbins of awesome with 31 Flavors. He'll make you laugh and make 
 you feel alright\, make you sweat to the beats allllllnight.\n\nWhen you sa
 y "punk rock" and "Bloomington" these days how many bands can you name? App
 lecore is one of these few remaining punk buffalo that keep the rock anthem
 s coming.\n\nThe Hard Candy Hearts have been called punk blues & blues punk
  & rock n' roll & rhythm and blues. I like to call them a wad of jagged ste
 el rolling down the highway spitting hot glass on the broken rocks and cont
 ained within the nucleus of this is the softest woman the world has even se
 en\, with open motherly arms and just a whiff of sex.\n\nIt'll be fun.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T051136Z
LOCATION:902 (formly Uncle Festers)
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Hard Candy Hearts\, Applecore\, Andy D
TRANSP:OPAQUE
