DESCRIPTION:   Arts Fair on the Square is a project of the Bloomington Area
  Arts Council. The BAAC serves as the foundation for the arts in the commun
 ity and six counties by delivering high quality arts programming and servic
 es and operating the Waldron Arts Center. \n   Arts Fair on the Square is c
 elebrating 29 years of bringing visual artists and craftspeople together wi
 th the local and regional buying community. Arts Fair on the Square is held
  on the picturesque ground surrounding the Monroe County Courthouse in down
 town Bloomington\, IN. \n    Arts Fair on the Square runs in conjunction wi
 th the Taste of Bloomington\, which offers sampling opportunities from over
  35 local and regional restaurants\, special music\, and children's activit
 ies. \n    Together Arts Fair on the Square and Taste of Bloomington draw t
 housands of visitors to downtown Bloomington to experience the finest the v
 isual arts has to offer while sharing a little of that Hoosier hospitality 
 that makes Arts Fair on the Square a favorite among artists and art patrons
  alike. 
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T051221Z
LOCATION:Downtown Bloomington on the Courthouse
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:29th Annual Arts Fair on the Square
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
