DESCRIPTION:Scott McCloud is a cartoonist and comic theorist\, and is well 
 known for his cult classic creation of the series Zot!. His other pieces of
  work include scripts for various Superman comics\, his non-fiction books r
 evolving around his studies of the craft and evolution of the industry\, an
 d much more.\n\nHe is an influential advocate in the world of underground c
 omics\, and has done presentations everywhere from Princeton\, NYU\, OSU\, 
 Pixar\, Disney Comic Writers Seminar\, and Harvard.\n\nThe lecture takes pl
 ace on Monday\, October 5th at 7pm in the IMU Whittenberger Auditorium. The
  event is free and will be followed by a Q&A and book signing.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T051220Z
LOCATION:Indiana Memorial Union
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Lecture: Scott McCloud\, All About Comics!
