DESCRIPTION:Local First Indiana is a non-profit network of locally-owned\, 
 independent businesses dedicated to preserving the unique character of Bloo
 mington and Monroe County\, and strengthening our local economy.\n\nJoin us
  for an inspiring presentation by Michelle Long\, executive director of the
  Business Alliance for Local Living Economies (BALLE)\, featuring stories\,
  images\, research and case studies that demonstrate how we can work togeth
 er to support and grow locally owned businesses and the future of our commu
 nity.\n\nReception to follow provided by Oliver Winery\, Upland Brewery\, B
 lu Boy Chocolate Cafe and Cakery\, The Green Bean\, Crazy Horse\, and more.
 \n\nFREE! and open to the public\n\n*** Please RSVP at www.localfirstindian
 a.org/rsvp.html ***
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T051759Z
LOCATION:KRC Catering\, 216 S. College Ave.
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Think Local First! Campaign Launch
TRANSP:OPAQUE
