 e both the CD and LP on sale a day early on Monday\, May 25th.\n\nIf you li
 ke what you hear\, and buy the CD or LP\, you will be registered to win a p
 air of free tickets to Grizzly Bear's live show at the historic Buskirk-Chu
 mley Theater on Tuesday\, June 9th!\n\nBut these aren't just any random gen
 eral admission tickets... these are magical tickets! The winner can choose 
 to either "watch from the wings"\, meaning backstage\, up close and persona
 l - or\, they can choose to have their favorite seats reserved (balcony\, f
 ront row center\, you name it!) And who knows\, maybe you'll meet the band\
 , too?\n\nAll purchasers of The Veckatimest on Monday will also get a free 
 poster and whatever other Grizzly Bear schwag is sent our way...\n\nWhat be
 tter way to start your Memorial Day BBQ?
