DESCRIPTION:One Moment investigates the nature of momentary experiences tha
 t are fleeting\, quickly dismissed and transitory. These moments are often 
 forgotten-they simply register as an image or feeling that gets pushed asid
 e by the next thing. This exhibition will allow the viewer to capture an in
 stantaneous glimpse of the current state of things\, and to consider the te
 mporal nature of existence. One Moment features paintings by Bob Jones\, Gr
 ant Schexnider\, and Stephanie Serpick\, a time-based media work by Cayetan
 o Ferrer\, photographs by Adam Ekberg\, and a mixed media installation by N
 oelle Mason. This exhibition is a collaboration between the SoFA Gallery an
 d the Thomas Robertello Gallery of Chicago\, Illinois.\n<br><br>\nA Gallery
  talk by art collector and gallerist Thomas Robertello will take place at 6
 :30pm on Friday\, October 17\, with an Opening Reception following from 7:0
 0 – 9:00 pm in the SoFA Gallery. All events are free and open to the public
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T051757Z
LOCATION:Sofa Gallery
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:One Moment Gallery Talk and Opening Reception
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
