DESCRIPTION:Katie Cornetta\, Bryce Martin\, and Nate Quiroz (from Decarcera
 te Monroe County!) will be joined by Tiga Wertz for an workshop on dealing 
 with cops and asserting your rights as a citizen.\n\nRoleplays performed by
  presenters will include various situations where police often stop people:
  on the street\, in a car\, and at a home.\n\nThe roleplays will be followi
 ng by an explanation of your basic rights\, and then a Q&A session.\n\nDisc
 laimer: None of the workshop facilitators are lawyers\, and cannot give you
  legal advice.
