DESCRIPTION:Our little marching band will be out and about in Bloomington d
 uring Lotus World Music Fest this coming Friday and Saturday. March with us
 . Bring noise makers and flags. Dress up. Party down.\n\nHere are the Specs
 -\n\nWe march Friday night: 6th street and Washington (ish) from 8:30 to 9.
  Join us!\nWe march twice Saturday: from 3rd street park to Kirkwood\, leav
 ing the park at 5:45.\nThe next time is with the main Lotus Fest Parade (on
  Kirkwood?) starting at 8:15.\n\nThe band rocks\, and features our friends 
 Jake Handelman\, Andy Goheen\, Sophie Faught\, Matt Nowlin\, Evan Noyes\, A
 nson Hohne\, Tyler Damon\, Drew Prichard\, and Ben Fowler. We play original
 s\, and music from Cuba and Mexico.
