DESCRIPTION:On August 15\, 2009\, the two Bleeding Heartland Rollergirls ho
 me teams\, the Farm Fatale and the Slaughter Scouts\, will face off for the
  first time this season. Come cheer on your favorite Bloomington team in wh
 at will surely be a fight to the finish. Last year the two teams tied with 
 one victory each. Now its time to settle the score.\n\nDoors will open at 6
 pm. The action starts promptly at 7pm.\n\nYou can purchase tickets online a
 t BrownPaperTickets.com. You can also find them offline at all Bloomingfood
 s locations\, Vintage Phoenix Comics\, Bloomington Sportsplex\, Sunrise Box
  Office or from your favorite rollergirl.\n\nTickets are $10 in advance or 
 $15 at the door.\nKids get in for $5. Kids under the age of 4 get in for fr
 ee.\n\nHalftime entertainment will be provided by The Coke Dares.\n\nThanks
  to all of the sponsors that made this event possible: Bloom Magazine\, Blo
 omingfoods\, Osmon Chiropractic Center\, Rolling Thunder Fun Factory\, Pizz
 a X\, and X-Printwear.\n\nA portion of the night proceeds will benefit Deep
  Roots Animal Sanctuary.\n
