DESCRIPTION:On Saturday\, June 12th\, the Bleeding Heartland Rollergirls’ W
 FTDA-sanctioned travel team\, the Flatliners\, face off against the Derby C
 ity Rollergirls of Louisville at the Twin Lakes Recreation Center. Fresh of
 f their win against the Gem City Rollergirls\, the Flatliners are looking t
 o make this a bout their fans won’t want to miss.\n\nThe rollergirls will b
 e collecting school and art supplies for Girls\, Inc. Donate an item from t
 heir wishlist (found at http://www.girlsinc-monroe.org/pages/donate.htm) an
 d get BHRG bucks in exchange!\n\nThe bout will take place at the Twin Lakes
  Recreation Center at 1700 W. Bloomfield Rd.\, on Saturday\, June 12th. Doo
 rs open at 6 PM. Bout starts at 7 PM.\n\nTickets are $10 in advance or $15 
 at the door. Kids tickets are $5. Children under 4 get in free. Tickets are
  available at Bloomingfoods\, Rolling Thunder Fun Factory\, Sunrise Box Off
 ice\, Twin Lakes Recreation Center\, Vintage Phoenix Comics\, and brownpape
 rtickets.com.\n\nCome out to support your local roller derby league!
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T051405Z
LOCATION:Twin Lakes Recreation Center\, 1700 W. Bloomfield Rd.
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:BHRG Flatliners vs Derby City Rollergirls
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
