CREATED:20101008T145933Z
DESCRIPTION:America\, the Greatest Country God ever gave Man\, was built on
  three bedrock principles: Freedom. Liberty.  And Fear - that someone might
  take our Freedom and Liberty. But now\, there are dark\, optimistic forces
  trying to take away our Fear -- forces with salt and pepper hair and way m
 ore Emmys than they need. They want to replace our Fear with reason. But ne
 ver forget - "Reason" is just one letter away from "Treason."  \n\nCoincide
 nce? Reasonable people would say it is\, but America can't afford to take t
 hat chance. So join The Rev. Sir Dr. Stephen T. Colbert\, D.F.A. on October
  30th for the "March to Keep Fear Alive" in Washington DC. Pack an overnigh
 t bag with five extra sets of underwear -- you're going to need them.   Bec
 ause\, to Restore Truthiness we must always... Shh!!! What's that sound?!  
 I think there's someone behind you! Run!\n\nFind out what your fellow citiz
 ens are doing to help Keep Fear Alive in the Colbert Nation forums. http://
 bit.ly/cMFMy0\n\nKeep checking back for updates and rally information.\nhtt
 p://www.keepfearalive.com/\nhttp://twitter.com/stephenathome\n\nFrequently 
 Asked Questions: http://bit.ly/bM6Ic0\nMessage Boards: http://bit.ly/cMFMy0
 \nOfficial March to Keep Fear Alive poster: http://bit.ly/aEoITS (jpg)\nSho
 p: http://bit.ly/9LJQmM\n\nAll net proceeds go to benefit the Yellow Ribbon
  Fund.\n\nhttp://www.facebook.com/event.php?eid=154317524597618
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T051111Z
LOCATION:The National Mall\, Washington\, DC
SEQUENCE:1866685
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:March to Keep Fear Alive
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
