 ater\nFriday March 25\n8pm\n$20\nall ages\n\nTickets on sale Wednesday Febr
 uary 9th\n\nWhen Wanda Jackson\, the justly crowned Queen of Rockabilly\, r
 ecorded “Let’s Have A Party\,” a tune she made into a hit of her own in 195
 8 even after one-time boyfriend Elvis Presley had released a version of it\
 , her delivery of the chorus wasn’t so much a suggestion as a command. As t
 he title – and\,
