 iendly (non-confrontational). We would love to see some children there. \n<
 br><br>\nAssuming the zombie walk is happening as it usually does\, I would
  like to steer the community ride to join in with the walk\, so zombie cost
 uming is encouraged. \n<br><br>\nPLEASE INVITE YOUR FRIENDS! I'd like this 
 months ride to be huge!
