DESCRIPTION:DAMIERA (New York\, NY)\nEqual Vision Records\nhttp://tour.dami
 era.com/\nhttp://www.myspace.com/damiera\nDamiera plays a very technical br
 and of upbeat post-hardcore with more time changes than a Swiss clock facto
 ry.\n-Evan McNamara\, reportermag.com\n\nMAN WITHOUT WAX (Seattle\, WA)\nht
 tp://www.myspace.com/manwithoutwax\n"Grand canyons of sound\, shoot-off voc
 al tirades\, and two guitarists to fill the room\, Seattle's Man Without Wa
 x are going for big... They plan on taking the orchestral\, progressive and
  throttling of major rock genres and pummeling them into your earlobes - in
  the most detailed and refined way."\n-AbsolutePunk.net\n\nSPANK RAY (Bloom
 ington\, IN)\nhttp://www.myspace.com/spankray\nThey'll spank you smartly!\n
 \nAPPLECORE (Bloomington\, IN)\nhttp://www.myspace.com/applecore\nA rock 'n
  roll explosion in your face!\n\nWhen? 4/20!\nTime? Doors 8pm\, show 9pm\nC
 ost? $8\nCause? Rocking and Rolling!
