DESCRIPTION:The Collaboration Room\n214 N. Rogers Street\, Bloomington\, IN
  47404\nContact: information@thecollaborationroom.org\, 812.334.8103\n\n\n“
 Printmaking You Can Do In Your Kitchen!”\n12-5pm with open studio afterward
 s for participants\nRegister by Feb. 10\, $15-20 donation\n\nIn this course
  you will learn a variety of approaches to quickly (and cheaply) create ric
 hly layered images through printmaking. You will learn how to print by hand
  using linoleum block\, woodcut\, collograph\, stencil\, and monoprinting t
 echniques. You will come away with a stack of prints and the ability to mak
 e more anywhere.  There will be an emphasis on experimentation with techniq
 ues and materials. No previous experience needed. Email (matthew at thecoll
 aborationroom.org) for more info.\n
