DESCRIPTION:WE4 2009: Women Exposed ~by Women for Women:\n\nA mixed media a
 rt exhibit and performances.\n\nMarch 27\, 28 & 29\nOpening reception: Marc
 h 27th 7-10 pm\n\nOriginally organized in 2004\, Women Exposed Art Show pro
 vides a venue for local and international talents in a nontraditional commu
 nity-based space. As WE\, we believe that Art is one of the most powerful a
 nd vulnerable form of expression and embrace “female values and experiences
  as a legitimate basis for the creation of “high” art”*\n\nWE gathers annua
 lly to create and share our art and endeavors with the local community and 
 to support organizations that help empower women. This year's proceeds will
  be donated to Middle Way House and the Rise to help strengthen their membe
 rs.\n\n*The Power of Feminist Art\, Norma Broude and Mary D. Garrard\, Harr
 y N. Abrahams Inc. 1994
