CREATED:20081113T142506Z
DESCRIPTION:You are invited to the First Annual Free Laughs Ivy Tech Comedy
  Night!\nHosted by the Bloomington Campus Activities Board.\nJoin us Friday
  November 21st from 7pm to 9pm for free refreshments and the improvisationa
 l comedy styling of Bloomington's very own group Awkward Silence\, as well 
 as stand-up preformance by Brian Frange!\nBring your friends\, family\, or 
 anyone you know.*\n<br><br>\nAdmission and refreshments free all night. Com
