DESCRIPTION:The School of Fine Arts (SoFA) Gallery is pleased to announce T
 he Holiday Art Sale + Auction\, a sale featuring current work donated by fa
 culty and students from the Henry Radford Hope School of Fine Arts at India
 na University. Additional works on display have been donated by the Friends
  of Art from anonymous donors and private collections. This event is being 
 held to help support the IU SoFA Gallery’s visual art programming and the i
 mportant advocacy programs\, including student scholarships administered by
  the Friends of Art. The sale will open Wednesday\, December 10th and end w
 ith a Silent Auction on Friday\, December12\, from 7:00 – 8:30pm in the SoF
 A Gallery. All events are free and open to the public.\n<br><Br>\nThe sale 
 will comprise works from the IU Fine Arts including jewelry\, photography\,
  painting\, printmaking\, ceramics and textiles. Visitors will have the opp
 ortunity to purchase beautiful wearable\, functional and non-functional art
  pieces made by Indiana University artists for themselves or as holiday gif
 ts for friends and family. Payments may be made by credit card\, check\, or
  cash.\n<Br><Br>\nOn Friday\, December 12\, The Holiday Art Sale + Auction 
 will be accompanied by the Fine Arts Student Award Ceremony for IU Fine Art
 s undergraduate students at 5:30 pm in Woodburn Hall room 100\, followed by
  an Opening Reception for IU Fine Arts student exhibitions and the IU Schoo
 l of Fine Arts Holiday Arts Party\, from 7:00 – 9:00 pm in the SoFA Gallery
 .
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T051312Z
LOCATION:SoFA Gallery
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:SoFA Holiday Art Sale\, Silent Auction\, & Award Ceremony
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
