BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Let's Go! Bloomington
DTSTART:20090305T010000Z
DTEND:20090305T050000Z
DTSTAMP:20260905T041548Z
UID:a9335ct5la0o20gqiotqkn2n5o@google.com
CREATED:20090226T165109Z
DESCRIPTION:Spirit of '68 Promotions and The Cinemat proudly present:\n\nCA
 PILLARY ACTION (from New York\; a must-see band\, constantly touring and co
 nstantly creating some of the most beautiful and jarring music you will eve
 r hear)\n\nwith very special guests\nBASILICA\nPUSH-PULL\nand RACEBANNON\n@
  The Cinemat\nMarch 4\n8pm. $5.\nALL AGES\n\nCapillary Action\nhttp://www.m
 yspace.com/capillaryaction\n"Capillary Action harness the power of the best
  of Zappa's more rocking efforts\, combining excellent jazz chops with punk
  energy\, making complicated arrangements sound natural...and then there ar
 e the [highly personal] lyrics\, when intelligible\, give greater gravitas 
 to the flow."\n- Exclaim Magazine\n\n2009 Capillary Action Line-Up (an acou
 stic quintet):\nJonathan Pfeffer- Vocals\, Nylon-String Guitar\, Musical Di
 rection\nDan Sutherland- Drums\, Percussion\nSpencer Russell- Upright Bass\
 , Vocals\nLauren Day- Accordion\, Vocals\nSam Kulik- Trombone\, Percussion\
 , Vocals\n\n\nRacebannon\nhttp://www.myspace.com/racebannonrocks\n"Midway b
 etween a deleted scene from River's Edge and the resurrection of Frankenste
 in to unleash havoc upon the villagers that put him under\, the Racebannon 
 sound is one of many disparate influences that blend seamlessly into one le
 thal cocktail of hatred and aggression\, draped in a cerecloth of pure molt
 en rock that is as unforgiving as it is pulse-quickening. Indie rock? No. M
 etal? No. Hardcore? No. Noise core? No. Racebannon? Yes. It really is that 
 simple."\n\nBasilica\nhttp://www.myspace.com/basilicaproject\n"BASILICA is 
 a virtuoso chamber music group that was founded in 2005 by composer Ben S. 
 Jacob in order to create uniquely powerful and intimate musical experiences
 . The current instrumentation of amplified string instruments and percussio
 n is the latest step in the evolution of a music that seeks to combine bold
  rhythms\, incisive harmonies\, broad yet angular melodies\, and towering s
 onorities into an experience of relentless intensity\, a raging discourse o
 n the fundamental emotionality that is at the core of human existence. The 
 team of classically trained musicians that has been assembled for this proj
 ect is dedicated to the perfection of sound and spirit that yields performa
 nces and recordings of uncommon precision\, power\, and beauty."\n\nPush-Pu
 ll (a rare acoustic performance)\nhttp://www.myspace.com/pushpull\n"The mus
 ic associates itself with all conditions including: humans\, diseases\, boo
 ks\, films\, dead hearts\, events predating the big bang\, flight\, empty h
 ands\, breeding\, fire\, water\, the jesuses and how to not panic. The soun
 d is tightly wedged between a rock and a roll\, hard and compact\, but fres
 h and piping hot. The final result is direct and spastic\; a bit cryptic\, 
 while simultaneously genuine like pay day. We are they. They are Mikes. Mik
 es are Push-Pull."
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T051451Z
LOCATION:The Cinemat
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:CAPILLARY ACTION\, RACEBANNON\, PUSH-PULL\, and BASILICA
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
