 rd concert 1985 film 'Blind Eye Sees All' by THE BUTTHOLE SURFERS was recor
 ded in Detroit on their 'Psychic... Powerless... Another Man's Sac' tour. I
 nterspersed with some seriously tripped out 'interview' segments\, this con
 cert changed my life when I bought it as a teenager... recently re-issued o
 n DVD\, we present it in all it's psychedelic glory.\n<Br><br>\nWe will als
 o be screening some VERY rare footage from the first couple BUTTHOLE SURFER
 S' concerts in the early 80's. These clips were hidden in the static way at
  the end of the original VHS release of 'Blind Eye Sees All' and subsequent
 ly left off the DVD release... luckily\, I still have my VHS copy!\n<br><br
 >\nCommencing at 9pm-ish\, ALL AGES\, FREE!!!\n<Br><br>\nTHE CINEMAT is now
