 xtravaganja - where we place two of the bestest DJ nights in town together 
 for one super duper night of music and mayhem.\n\nThe No! MTV Raps crew bri
 ngs the old school jamz from your childhood thru some of today's best bange
 rs. Soul in the Hole bring the tunes you might have been conceived to - the
  sweet soul and dance floor funk from yesteryear. Together its an eclectic 
 mix of classics\, songs that were inspired by these classics\, and the clas
 sics of tomorrow.\n\n9pm - 3am :: $3 gets you 6 DJs :: cheap\, strong drink
 s :: good times!\n\nfeaturing DJs: Spikes\, Wally Wonder\, Counts of Bounce
