DESCRIPTION:Monster Art Show\nFriday October 30th\n6pm @ Art Hospital\n\nMo
 nster Art Show by husband and wife artists Luke and Becky Woodaman. Featuri
 ng paintings\, sculptures\, box monsters\, monster costumes\, masks\, and m
 onster hats to buy just in time for Halloween.\n\nBecky's monsters are amal
 gams of different creatures that exist mutating into hybrids in response to
  global climate change. They will be represented in\; acrylic paintings on 
 paper\, plushies\,  and sculptures of super sculpey with acrylic paint.  \n
 \nLuke's monsters are mixed-media experimentations. The imagery is anything
  from demons to beasts and are inspired by old horror movies\, anime\, low-
 brow\, and folklore.  They are represented in ink\, graphite\, pastel\, acr
 ylic\, spray\, and charcoal on paper\, canvas\, and cardboard.
