DESCRIPTION:Independent artist (poet/musician) Bradley Hathaway of Goshen\,
  Arkansas\, plans to take his band on the road this spring\, and will be do
 ing a special show at the Pourhouse Cafe in downtown Bloomington\, just off
  of the IU campus.\n\nBradley plays a soft and sincere type of folk/pop mus
 ic. It's simple\, it's catchy\, and it's fun. Best of all Bradley's a frien
 dly guy\, and puts on a pretty great show.\n\nOn tour to support him is Aar
 on Lee Martin\, and also on the show will be two area favorites (Jonah Mala
 rsky & Chemic). So\, come out\, grab a drink\, and enjoy the start of your 
 summer with us.... This is seriously going to be an incredible show\, and f
 or only five bucks.
