CREATED:20090721T133002Z
DESCRIPTION:DRAKKAR SAUNA\nw/ Aaron Deer & Chris Barth\nSunday July 26\n@ B
 ear's Place\n9pm\n$6\n\nDrakkar Sauna\nwww.myspace.com/drakkansasauna\n----
 ----------\n\nIf not the first\, then surely the most common question we ar
 e asked is how we came to name ourselves Drakkar Sauna. We want to tell you
 . We want you to know\, if only so that you’ll stop asking. It makes us fee
 l vulnerable\, it makes us feel judged.\n\nWe thought it sounded like a pal
 indrome. What it comes down to is we didn’t have any scratch paper handy an
 d our understanding of what a palindrome is wasn’t accurate. But that’s wha
 t happened. ‘Drakkar’sounded like a palindrome. So did ‘Sauna’. We thought 
 that two palindromes would make one bigger palindrome. Obviously\, we were\
 , in part\, mistaken. I hope now your curiosity is satisfied and you will n
 ot think too poorly of us for our incomplete command of the language.\n\nWe
  live in Lawrence\, Kansas and are fathers to three full-length recordings\
 , Rover\, Drakkansasauna\, & Jabraham Lincoln.\n\nWe have recorded\, also\,
  an ep\, Hunger Overcame Us and helped produce a feature video\, "The Blood
  Feud\," a work of fiction. We are\, in all things\, supported by our union
  with Marriage Records. We have toured the U.S.A. a few times. We have tour
 ed with Dark Meat and the Vomit Lazers Family Galaxy\, Split Lip Rayfield\,
  The Impossible Shapes\, Two Gallants\, Magnolia Electric Company and by ou
 rselves.\n\nOur names are Jeff Stolz and Wallace Cochran and we get along w
 ell.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T052113Z
LOCATION:Bear's Place
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Drakkar Sauna
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
