UID:h75sm78f2al092g6ofiu900gs0@google.com
CREATED:20081021T155607Z
DESCRIPTION:$35 in advance<br>\n$40 on day of show\n<Br><br>\nFour local no
 n-profit agencies - The Shalom Community Center\, Mother Hubbard's Cupboard
 \, Stepping Stones and Martha's House - serving those experiencing homeless
 ness and poverty throughout Monroe County have collaborated for the week of
  November 16 - 22\, 2008 to focus the community's attention on the National
  Hunger & Homelessness Awareness Week.  The events of the week will highlig
 ht the unending need for the community to support these agencies in their t
 ireless work and will culminate with a comedy event on Saturday\, November 
 22\, 2008\, BLOOMINGTON\, STAND UP!\, featuring Drew Hastings at the Buskir
 k-Chumley Theater. \n<Br><br>\nTickets are available at the Sunrise Box Off
 ice for $35 in advance or $40 at the door. The price includes two drink cou
 pons (issued at entry) for wine\, soda or water\, and dessert and cheese ta
 stings. Doors open at 6:45 pm and the show starts at 7:30 pm. \n<Br><br>\nD
 rew Hastings is a raconteur with a lot of stories to tell. Before becoming 
 a comedian at age thirty-one\, his escapades included owning a trucking bus
 iness\, running a document shredding company that never actually shredded a
 ny documents\, leading archaeological expeditions (some would call him "loo
 ter") to South America\, and playing polo with stolen horses at polo clubs 
 in Washington\, DC and Cincinnati\, OH. Drew is excited to take part in thi
 s event.\n<br><br>\nSponsors for Bloomington\, Stand Up! include the Office
  of the Mayor – City of Bloomington\, the Herald-Times\, IU Credit Union\, 
 Oliver Winery\, Hilton Garden Inn\, Blu Boy Café & Cakery\, Bloomington Coo
 king School\, Tutto Bene\, Angel B's Galleria of Cakes\, Baked!\, Blondie’s
 \, Bloomingfoods\, Indiana Memorial Union’s Sugar & Spice and Sahara Mart a
 nd Graham Farms Cheese.\n<br><br>\nFor more information about National Hung
 er and Homeless Awareness Week events in Bloomington\, visit www.bloomingto
 npoverty.wordpress.com.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T052038Z
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Bloomington\, Stand Up! - Drew Hastings
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
