DESCRIPTION:High Society is a glossy\, Technicolor\, musical remake of MGM’
 s classic 1940 comedy\, The Philadelphia Story. It’s impossible to improve 
 upon the original movie’s stellar combination of Katherine Hepburn\, Cary G
 rant\, and James Stewart\, but the remake compensates with a half-dozen son
 gs and a sensational musical score by Cole Porter. In this delightful romp 
 through the troubled lives of America's rich and ridiculous\, tabloid repor
 ters invade a society wedding. Sinatra and Crosby slip on the Stewart and G
 rant roles like tailor-made suits\, while Grace Kelly adds star power witho
 ut attempting to match the lofty standard set by Hepburn. For no particular
  reason\, Louis Armstrong joins the proceedings\, much to the delight of an
 yone who cares anything about music. HIGH SOCIETY (1956) – 111 minutes
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T052139Z
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Free Movie: High Society
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
