 ind out about the project\, work on their own project\, work on ongoing col
 laborative projects\, or to develop something new on the spot. Sessions inc
 lude drawing\, collage\, painting\, printmaking\, video\, animation as well
  as conversations\, declarations and celebrations. You are welcome to bring
