DESCRIPTION:214 N. Rogers Street\, Bloomington\, IN 47404\nContact: informa
 tion@thecollaborationroom.org\, 812.334.8103\n\nDo you want valentine’s day
  cards that change the lives of recipients? Do you have a special project f
 or that special someone? Come to The Collaboration Room for support\, guida
 nce and camaraderie. Email (information at thecollaborationroom.org) for mo
 re info.\n\nFriday Night Sessions at The Collaboration Room are open hours 
 for anyone to come by\, say hello\, find out about the project\, work on th
 eir own project\, work on ongoing collaborative projects\, or to develop so
 mething new on the spot. Sessions include drawing\, collage\, painting\, pr
 intmaking\, video\, animation as well as conversations\, declarations and c
 elebrations. You are welcome to bring friends\, bring materials\, bring ide
 as and bring food. You are welcome! Email (information at thecollaborationr
 oom.org) for more info.\n
