DESCRIPTION:http://thecinemat.com/drupal/\n\n---\nSunday\, February 22 is O
 scar™ Night\, which may as well be a holiday here at The Cinemat\, so we’re
  celebrating\, as is our way\, with beer and popcorn. Admission is free\, p
 lus you can fill out a nominee ballot for the chance to win free movie rent
 als. First prize is a Dolly Grip Package (12 rental credits)\, Second Prize
  is a Best Boy Package (5 rental credits)\, so come down to The Screening R
 oom and join us in making jokes about the show running too long\, presenter
 s mangling the names of Best Documentary: Short Subject nominees\, and that
  one montage of Gene Kelly on the streetlamp in "Singin’ in the Rain." Acco
 rding to "The New York Times\," the producers of the show have promised a n
 ight of surprises with little hint of what that might portend\, so we’re al
 l very excited. The telecast begins at 8 PM.\n\nAnd\, yes\, I am aware that
  "Singin' in the Rain" and "The New York Times" should be italicized\, not 
 in quotes\, but I don't know how do that with this particular blog technolo
 gy\, so all you grammarphiles that would submit me to unnecessayquotes.com 
 will just have to pretend. Sorry.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T052046Z
LOCATION:The Cinemat
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:OSCAR Night Party
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
