DESCRIPTION:Recently\, the news has been overflowing with information about
  the suicides of LGBTQQI youth.  In light of these tragedies\, the day of O
 ctober 20\, 2010 has been dedicated to standing up for those who thought it
  impossible to stand up for themselves.  People\, all around the world\, ar
 e invited to wear purple.  On the LGBTQQI flag\, purple is the color of spi
 rit.  World\, let's get together and make a change! WEAR PURPLE!\n\nLesbian
 \nGay\nBisexual\nTransgendered\nQuestioning\n\nAlso\, invite any and all fr
 iends you may have. Straight allies and gay allies\, everyone can make a di
 fference!\n\n\n-Jacqueline and Nikki\n\nNote: This event is the sister even
 t of the original. It is targeting primarily the south (United States)\, bu
 t all are welcome to join and provide support.\n\nhttp://www.facebook.com/e
 vent.php?eid=143955038982540
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T052044Z
LOCATION:Where Ever You Live In This World
SEQUENCE:1045841
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Wearing Purple for the LGBT
TRANSP:OPAQUE
