DESCRIPTION:A richly intelligent compilation of international reportage bro
 adcast in November 2007 for La Nuit Gay on French TV's Canal Plus channel. 
 This is an enlightened and fascinating portrait of lesbian\, gay and transg
 ender lives as they are lived now\, unlike anything you might see on Britis
 h television.\n\nThe films offer a personal insight into different scenes: 
 in a tattooed model who is also a former Mr Leather\, Germany is depressed 
 by the paucity of gay culture. In Paris there's a view of life for a rightw
 ing gay activist as Sarkozy comes to power and a paean to a much-loved lesb
 ian rock club. A trans couple in Madrid look to the outside world like a mo
 del of heteronormativity and we take a trip into the lesbian underground in
  Havana. Not forgetting a fascinating excursion around Beijing with filmmak
 er Cui Zi'en and a transvestite guide to Madrid Gay Pride. 
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T052125Z
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:PRIDE Film Fest: Gay\, So What?
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
