DESCRIPTION:Lou Barlow has been writing and recording songs\, sometimes obs
 essively\, for over 2 decades. His name is practically synonymous with this
  thing that some would call indie-rock. Barlow has been an integral force i
 n some of the most successful and influential underground bands of the last
  two decades—Deep Wound\, Dinosaur Jr.\, Sebadoh\, The Folk Implosion. Argu
 ably the most prolific songwriter of his generation\, Lou Barlow was also t
 he one of the most influential\; thanks to his lo-fi legacy\, any geek with
  a guitar\, a four-track machine and an unrequited crush on a girl could be
 come an underground pop star.\n\nLandlocked Music is pleased as punch to pr
 esent a FREE instore performance from Lou before Dinosaur Jr's awesome and 
 soon to be legendary show at the Bluebird on Friday\, April 10th.\n\n6PM - 
 ALL-AGES - FREE - FRIDAY APRIL 10TH
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T051957Z
LOCATION:Landlocked Music
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Lou Barlow
TRANSP:OPAQUE
