CREATED:20090708T065756Z
DESCRIPTION:YER MOM LIKES TO PARTY TOO\na benefit for Ben Fowler's mother.\
 n\n\nHey Everybody-\n\nFour years ago\, my mom Deb received a Mild Traumati
 c Brain Injury after being rear-ended in her car by a 17-year old on his ce
 ll phone. Since that time\, she has had a long and arduous journey through 
 the medical\, insurance\, social services\, and legal systems. Before this 
 accident\, my mom had a full work life\, maintained her rural home and prop
 erty\, came to my concerts\, and cheered me on in my musical endeavors\, ad
 vocated for green building in our area\, and was tireless in her efforts to
  build awareness about the genocide in Darfur. She's the bomb.\nNow she's g
 one through a trial to try to get a settlement from the young guy's car ins
 urance company: She won\, but the settlement is so small that the money wil
 l ALL be going to her lawyers and her insurance company (for past medical b
 ills).\nSo we are going to host a series of parties/concerts to help her wi
 th her mortgage and monthly bills\, to keep her afloat as we try to get som
 ething else figured out. Thanks in advance for any help\, donations\, or id
 eas that you can send our way during this process. Now let's party!\n\nSinc
 erely\,\nBen Fowler\n\n\n\nSaturday July 11\n6pm\n@ Ben's house\n218 S. Jef
 ferson St.\n\nCome party with us and support your friends.\n\nThere will be
  lots of foods (tacos and taco paraphernalia and taco accessories and the l
 ike) to eat ($5 suggested donation) and drinks to drink ($ donations please
 ) and friends to see. The eating shall start at 6pm\, and there will be mus
 ics to enjoy soon after that. The musical performers (performing their song
 s "round-robin" style -- one person will play a song and pass it on to the 
 next person\, and so on\, etc.\, indefinitely) for this edition of YMLTP wi
 ll include:\n\nEric Ayotte\nMike Bushman\nEvan Copelly\nBen Fowler\nMark Ga
 lup\nAndy Goheen\nep hall\nJeff Shew\nMatt Toby\nBen Tousley\nDavid Woodruf
 f\nand more???!!!???\n\nYou don't necessarily need to know Ben or his mom o
 r any of us in order to come to this event. If you want to come only to wit
 ness intimate performances by some of your favorite local songwriters\, tha
 t is okay with us (but please do bring cash donations if you can). We are a
 ll very kind and welcoming people. And some of us cook some really tasty fo
 od. So please come.\n\nSee you there!\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T052132Z
LOCATION:218 S. Jefferson St. 
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Benefit! YER MOM LIKES TO PARTY TOO 
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
