UID:e138732346172987@facebook.com
URL:http://www.facebook.com/event.php?eid=138732346172987
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20101001T110535Z
DESCRIPTION:902's Nightclub (formerly Uncle Fester's) presents:\n\nThe Roll
 ing Blackouts\n\nThe Rolling Blackouts are a band not afraid to dabble with
  varying dynamics and lengthy build-ups. Bloomington natives\, The Rolling 
 Blackouts have a lackadaisical\, airy\, yet pop-fueled sound that is riddle
 d with bits of tension and anxiety. “The Ever Elusive Giant Squid” is a hig
 hlight\, with its forceful\, driving verses giving way to melancholy and at
 mospher...ic layers\, showcasing the band’s ability to build energy and exp
 lode furiously. The Rolling Blackouts’ rich\, crunchy soundscapes are at th
 e front line in the war against stale and mundane rock and roll.\n\nTriptid
 es\n\nTriptides are fun. Composed of three of Bloomingont's most outstandin
 g young men\, Triptides take your most inner ear drums back to a time when 
 life was simple and before beaches were cesspools of used medical waste and
  alleys of undertow danger. Each song sounds immediately familiar and warm\
 , with a vocal styling conjuring comparisons to Fleet Foxes or The Dodos. T
 heir self-description says it all best\, "A fun beach party in a basement i
 n your brain."\n\n\n$3 cover\, must be 21+ to attend\n\nTo hear these acts\
 , click the links below.\n\nhttp://www.facebook.com/event.php?eid=138732346
 172987
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T052321Z
LOCATION:902's Nightclub\, 419 North Walnut\, Bloomington\, IN
SEQUENCE:46
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Live @ 902's: The Rolling Blackouts\, Triptides
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
