DESCRIPTION:\nA couple weekends ago a dear friend to me\, as well as most o
 f you\, Rob Funkhouser\, was jumped by 6 dudes walking home one night. they
  stole $70 and beat the living daylights out of him\, resulting in 3 broken
  bones in his face that required reconstructive surgery.\n<br><br>\nThis is
  a show that will be taking donations that will all go to him and his famil
 y for the medical bills that followed the tragedy.\n<Br><Br>\nDO NOT PARK O
 N WYLIE FOR THIS SHOW!!!!!!\ninstead\, park on grant or lincoln.\n<br><br>\
 nGET THERE AT 9:30\n<Br><br>\n\n\nAlexander the Great\n<Br><br>\nSlippertai
 ls (Nick Casertano plays half solo set) then plays a few songs with bryant 
 and jersey (think punk/pavement/rock)\n<br><Br>\nThe Giggles
