DESCRIPTION:It's that time of the year again\, and LFB Club Night is coming
  to you in full swing with TWO NIGHTS of great live music from an all-local
  lineup.\n\nLive From Bloomington Club Night is an annual event put on by U
 nion Board's Live From Bloomington committee. Every year LFB makes a compil
 ation CD of songs submitted by local musicians. Club Night is the debut of 
 the CD and its artists in multiple venues across downtown Bloomington.\n\nF
 or just $5 or $3 + 2 canned goods\, you get into an entire evening of local
  music. Extra donations are welcome\, and ALL PROCEEDS (CD sales\, admissio
 n) are donated to Hoosier Hills Food Bank.\n\nFriday Lineup:\n\nThe Cinemat
  (9pm): Jonah Malarsky\, Secrets Between Sailors\, e.p. hall\, Eric Radoux\
 ,\n\nRhino's All-Ages Club (8:00 pm): Spank Ray\, The Country Death\, Apple
 core\, Red Bird\n\nCollins Coffee House (7:30 pm): Spirit Spine\, Feso\, Im
 pure Jazz\, Alexander the Great\, FESO\n\nRachael's Cafe (8pm): Jenn Cristy
 \, Everybody\, The Pirate Flags\, You're a Liar\n\nPay at one venue\, and y
 ou get ALL FOUR!
