DESCRIPTION:Spirit of '68 Presents:\n<br><br>\nMAPS & ATALASES<br>\nNURSES<
 br>\nKENTUCKY NIGHTMARE<br>\n@ Jakes<br>\nWednesday September 17th\nDoors 8
 pm<br>\n$6<br>\n21+<br>\nTickets available at Landlocked Music and ticketma
 ster.com\n<br><br>\nMaps & Atlases is a math rock band from Chicago. Their 
 latest album “You And Me And The Mountain” was just released on July 1st. “
 You And Me And The Mountain” combines both the rhythmic diversity and preci
 sion of their math-rock brethren Battles and Hella while incorporating thei
 r own variety of swirly melodies. This genius concoction uses the sweet and
  thoughtful melodies as a gateway into the not-forgotten intellectual value
  that math-rock is known for.\n<br><br>\nNurses is know for their melody ba
 sed\, quirky songwriting. Traveling in the same vein as Of Montreal as far 
 as song format\, but with a greater focus on instrumental and vocal diversi
 ty—all four band members share singing duties and play multiple instruments
 .\n<br><br>\nBloomington’s own Kentucky Nightmare is a four member band wit
 h both clever lyrics\, interesting rhythms and call and response vocals.\n<
 br><br>\nwww.spiritof68promotions.com
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T052435Z
LOCATION:Jake's
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Maps & Atlases\, Nurses\, & Kentucky Nightmare
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
