DESCRIPTION:\nCall for Entries/ Silent Auction donations\nThe Trashion Refa
 shion Show is looking for innovative designs made from 90% recycled materia
 ls.\n\nThe juried show has two categories:\nTrashion is the result of creat
 ively turning discarded items into fashion.\n...Refashion is the result of 
 modifying existing clothing into something more fashionable.\nDesign submis
 sion deadline is February 1st\, 2011\n\nThe Center for Sustainable Living i
 s asking for donations of items\nto auction off during The Trashion Refashi
 on Show\, a juried\, runway fashion show that will take place on March 26th
 \, 2011 at the Bloomington Convention Center. We would especially like dona
 tions of items made\nfrom recycled materials.\n\nThe Trashion Refashion sho
 w is a fundraisor for the Center for Sustainable Living\, a non-profit comm
 unity organization that promotes sustainable ways of living in the Blooming
 ton community.\nFor more information about the CSL visit www.simplycsl.org\
 n\nFor more information about submitting a design or donation an auction it
 em\, email: bloomingtontrashion@gmail.com
