DESCRIPTION:CALIFONE\n@ Bear's Place\nFriday October 30\n9pm\n$12\n21+\n\nT
 ickets on sale this Friday at Landlocked\, TD's\, and through the Buskirk-C
 humley box office.\n\nThe band is at the peak of its powers on All My Frien
 ds Are Funeral Singers\, its sixth song based album. The long-awaited follo
 w-up to 2006’s acclaimed Roots and Crowns\, the album is the strongest coll
 ection of songs in a career with no shortage of strength. The subtlety and 
 detail of Califone’s previous work is present here – the atmospheres are ca
 refully nuanced\, the percussion is both rattling and melodic\, the melodie
 s are rich and soulful\, interspersed throughout softly strummed folk and e
 lectrified blues. All My Friends Are Funeral Singers is a dense collage of 
 sounds\, expertly formed into fully realized pop songs.\n\nwww.myspace.com/
 califonemusic
