DESCRIPTION:From the Website:<br>Filled with purple and green monster gore\
 , trippy sci-fi visuals\, and gorgeous practical effects\, GAMERA VS. GUIRO
 N is easily our favorite movie in which a monster with a knife for a head s
 lices up a giant bat creature. Two young boys sneak aboard a spaceship and 
 find themselves whisked away to the mysterious planet Terra. There\, they e
 ncounter Gamera's old foe Gyaos and two female aliens with a taste for huma
 n brains. Gamera must save the children and battle the new monster Guiron\,
  whose entire body is a deadly living weapon. <a href="https://www.youtube.
 com/watch?v=_SdM-CwOCB8">Trailer</a><br> <br>Thursday 3/16. $5 18+ (Two sho
 wtimes 7:pm 9:30)<br><a href="https://cicadacinema.com/products/gamera-vs-g
 uiron-march-16-orbit-room-7pm">Event Page</a>
