DESCRIPTION:Genealogy Group- Wednesday\, Jan 5\, 2pm with Barbara Truesdell
  Barbara\, Assistant Director of the Center for the Study of History and Me
 mory\, will discuss the purpose and practice of oral history as part of gen
 ealogical research. This presentation is free and open to the public. The G
