DESCRIPTION:from punknews.org: "If you’ve never heard of MC Chris\, you mig
 ht know him best as MC Pee Pants from the Aqua Teen Hunger Force or Hesh fr
 om "Sealab 2021." That’s right: This high-pitched comedy oddity has a promi
 nent rap career. His songs range from such subjects as Boba Fett to finding
  the clitoris\, Robatussin to Reese’s Pieces and various other humorous sub
 jects. To make things even better\, he’s really good at what he does. His r
 hymes are blazing fast and flow from his mouth like water. He knows how to 
 write catchy hooks for his songs and just plain excellent rhythms throughou
 t. MC Chris is really an anomaly in a sea of shitty hip-hop. He knows he’s 
 good\, but he doesn’t take himself seriously at all. He has fun with what h
 e does and he knows to get everyone else to have a good time too."\n\nThe a
 stounding Math the Band will also be playing this show!\n\nTickets are $12 
 in advance or $15 at the door. You can get them at Rhino's\, Landlocked\, T
 racks\, the BCT or online:\nhttps://www.efoliotickets.com/FolioProd/PickEve
 nt.aspx?VId=19&EventId=10195&EventName=MC%20Chris
