DESCRIPTION:The studio will be hosting a benefit for The Project School on 
 Friday\, August 7th. The event begins at 7:00 pm\, and will feature perform
 ances by the following bands:\n\nGentleman Caller\nThe Unravelers\nKate Lon
 g\n\nOn August 17 The Bloomington Project School\n(http://www.theprojectsch
 ool.org/) will open for the first time. The school\nis the first charter sc
 hool in Monroe County and the first charter school in\nthe state of Indiana
  designed entirely by educators. The mission of The\nProject School is to u
 ncover\, recover and discover the unique gifts and\ntalents that each child
  brings to school every day. This year the school\nwill serve children in g
 rades Kindergarten through seventh grade\, adding\neighth grade next year. 
 Through the problem-\, place-\, project- based\ncurriculum\, students ident
 ify real issues in their communities and utilize\ncommunity assets to addre
 ss those issues. The Project School is committed\nto teaching the whole chi
 ld and developing socially conscious citizens who\nnot only work well with 
 others\, but also lead others and contribute to the\ngreater good.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T051908Z
LOCATION:Russian Recording
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:The Project School Benefit Show
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
