DESCRIPTION:BFA Entertainment and Spirit of '68 Promotions presents...\n\nT
 HE GAME\nw/ Nipsey Hussle\nClyde Carson\n@ Jake'sNightclub\nTuesday March 2
 4th\n9pm\n$25 adv/$28 door\nTickets on sale this Friday at noon at the Jake
 's box office\, Landlocked Music\, Tracks\, and Ticketmaster\n\nThe Game\nw
 ww.myspace.com/thegame\n--------------\nThe Game has risen from a mixtape p
 henomenon to become a hip-hop icon. Raised on the same Compton streets that
  gave birth to Eazy E\, Dr. Dre\, and N.W.A.\, The Game's grimy\, guttural 
 flow details the highs\, lows\, and harsh realities of life in one of Ameri
 ca's most notorious neighborhoods. His three albums have sold nearly 10 mil
 lion records worldwide on the strength of smash hits including "Hate It Or 
 Love It featuring 50 Cent\," "It's Okay (One Blood)\," and the "My Life fea
 turing Lil' Wayne. From the streets to bbqs to bedrooms across the United S
 tates and beyond\, The Game is one the leading voices not only of the West 
 Coast\, but hip-hop itself.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T051925Z
