DESCRIPTION:Intersex Awareness Day is a day of grassroots action and consci
 ousness-raising dedicated to ending the shame\, secrecy\, invisibility\, an
 d nonconsensual genital surgeries associated with being intersex.\n\nTo rec
 ognize this day\, NOGLSTP at IU is hosting a screening of a film recommende
 d by the Intersex Society of North America: "Is It a Boy or a Girl?". We wi
 ll also offer an opportunity after the film to discuss critically both issu
 es raised within the film and society at large.\n\nhttp://www.facebook.com/
 event.php?eid=170107663006331
