UID:b4bdd4l7ncgu4vfqqsq28h07lg@google.com
CREATED:20091111T174706Z
DESCRIPTION:This is The Angry Dome's inaugural concert with celebratory pot
 luck!\n\nWe are delighted to host Layne Garrett from Washington\, DC. His o
 utput is extensive\, both solo and in collaboration. Layne plays guitar\, p
 ercussion\, and any number of prepared and home-made instruments. These hav
 e included 3rd-bridge resonator guitars\, car-part percussion sculptures\, 
 and a 10-foot-long sitar made from a 2x4. One of his most ambitious project
 s involved placing about 100 tape players playing prepared 30-second loop t
 apes around a masonry depository in Rock Creek Park. His meditative perform
 ances meld folk\, psychedelia\, noise\, and free-improv.\nhttp://www.questi
 onthetruth.com/\nhttp://www.myspace.com/lostspaces\n\nLone Logician (J. W. 
 Hall) is a Bloomington native. He brings together synthesizers\, software\,
  and found objects to to create a body of work that ranges from frenetic\, 
 danceable breakbeat to dark\, rumbling soundscapes. Combining audio and vis
 ual components makes for an interdisciplinary approach that aims for a unit
 y of thought\, feeling\, and aesthetic.\nhttp://www.lonelogician.com\nhttp:
 //www.myspace.com/lonelogician\n\nCanid (Colin Jenkins) is a recent transpl
 ant to Bloomington from DC. His sound derives from constantly shifting laye
 rs of cheap keyboards\, tape hiss\, wordless chanting\, aleatoric rhythms\,
  and radio talk shows.\nhttp://www.myspace.com/canidsounds\n\n\nThis an all
 -ages event.\nBring food\, bring beer\, bring friends.\nVegan/vegetarian fo
 od is preferred.\nPlease don't drink if you are under 21.\n\nLayne is touri
 ng the country on his own and could really use your help (check out the tou
 r schedule on his myspace page). Please bring a $3-$10 donation. All the mo
 ney will go to him.\n\nThis is mainly an ambient/experimental performance. 
 Don't feel like you have to sit and listen attentively. Feel free to wander
  the house\, converse\, eat\, lie down\, read.
