DESCRIPTION:The Bishop presents:\n\nKENTUCKY NIGHTMARE\nand SECONDARY MODER
 N\n@ the Bishop\nThursday\, Feb. 4th\n9pm\n18+\n$4\n\n\nKENTUCKY NIGHTMARE\
 nhttp://www.myspace.com/kentuckynightmare\nOne of Bloomington's best and mo
 st-venerated rock bands. Don't miss this chance to see them for only $4. fo
 r real.\n\nSECONDARY MODERN\nhttp://www.myspace.com/secondarymodern\n"A rec
 ently revamped line-up and new musical ideas...no more complete sentences. 
 A midwestern-dirt-vision of guitar pop. "Everyone plays everything" is how 
 we respond to some questions. "sixties pop" -- "post-punk" -- "shit...I don
 't know" are things we overhear. A good friend recently referred to our sou
 nd as "madman rock." What does that mean? We wish that words were irreleven
 t. Spoon-fed on The Beatles\, we hit our stride when we learned how to soun
 d unlike them. So\, what exactly are we then? "\n\n\nhttp://www.thebishopba
 r.com\nhttp://www.myspace.com/thebishopbar 
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T052111Z
