DESCRIPTION:WOMEN EXPOSED 5: Art Exhibition. Musical and other Performances
 . Good Times. All benefiting Middle Way House and The Rise.\n\nDue to the o
 verwhelming success of previous year’s WOMEN EXPOSED ART\, MUSIC and PERFOR
 MANCES\, this year’s event will expand the number of artists from diverse b
 ackgrounds and disciplines. More than twenty local female artists and music
 ians are set to expose themselves and their talents on May 1st\, 2010\, fro
 m 6.30pm to 2am Sunday May2nd\, at Space 101 located at 6th St (2nd floor) 
 in Bloomington\, Indiana. Musical and other performances will take place th
 roughout the evening. The visual art portion will remain open for view on S
 unday\,May 2nd from\, 9am to 9pm. Proceeds from the admission benefit Middl
 e Way House and The Rise.\n\nWE believes that Art is one of the most powerf
 ul form of expression and embrace “female values and experiences as a legit
 imate basis for the creation of “high” art (Broude & Garrard)."\n\nWE gathe
 rs annually to create and share our art and endeavors with the local commun
 ity and to support organizations that help empower women.\n\nWE works to fu
 se female and/or women-affirmative artists and their community.\n\nThe miss
 ion of the Middle Way House is to end violence in the lives of women and ch
 ildren by implementing or sponsoring activities and programs aimed at achie
 ving individual and social change. To learn more visit:\n\nhttp://www.bloom
 ington.in.us/~mwhouse/aboutus.htm\n\nSliding scale donations at the door: 5
 -10$ \n\nThere will be 10 minutes interval between most performances:\n\nOu
 tside:\n5-6pm Maypole set up\n6.00 Hudsucker Posse\n6.30 The Women of Bango
 fla Music Ensemble\n7.30 The Vallures\n8.00 The Dark Side Tribal\n8.30 Kare
 n Taborn\n8.50 Eco-Atelier Fashion Walk\n9.00 Kali-ma\n\nInside:\n9.30 Jami
 e Nichole\n9.50 Raffle\n10.00 Kati Gleiser\n10.20 Eco-Atelier Fashion Walk\
 n10. 30 Evelyn Davis\n11. Merrie Sloan April\n11.30 Janece Jaffe\n12.00 Bre
 ak\n12.30 Bloomington Burlesque Brigade 
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T052227Z
LOCATION:The Lodge 101 - 6th St.
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Bloomington Women Exposed Benefit Art Show Day 1
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
