DESCRIPTION:HERE IT IS #4 - Art by Erin Tobey\n\nYou are cordially invited 
 to a retrospective show of all work from my studies at the Henry Radford Ho
 pe School of Fine Arts at Indiana University. Media include video\, weaving
 \, screen printing\, sculpture\, quilting\, intaglio\, collagraphy\, bookma
 king\, and drawing. Most included - little omitted! For one night only\, se
 e the real art student experience from beginning to end! Two years\, lost -
  FOUND!\n\nI am graduating with a studio art degree eleven years in the mak
 ing\, so come help us celebrate. Art\, food\, drinks\, family\, friends\, e
 tc. It will go later than the rest so feel free to come by after the shows 
 at SoFA\, Space 101 and elsewhere.\n\n********
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T051926Z
LOCATION:401 S. Rogers St.
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Art Opening: HERE IT IS #4 - Art & Graduation by Erin Tobey
