DESCRIPTION:Taught by TCR’s John Berry (www.johngberry.com)\nSaturday: 10am
 -1pm\, 2-5pm\nSunday: 2-5pm\nRegister by Feb. 15\, $30-40 donation\nEgg tem
 pera\, one of the grandparents of painting\, can teach us how other types o
 f paintings work.  With its capacity for fine detail or wash-like painting\
 , its a wonderful way to experiment with different painting "voices".  In t
 his 2 day workshop\, we'll go over everything needed to make an egg tempera
  painting.  You can paint any type of image\, from abstract to photorealist
 ic. Email (john@thecollaborationroom.org) for more info.\n\n\nThe Collabora
 tion Room\n214 N. Rogers Street\, Bloomington\, IN 47404\nContact: informat
 ion@thecollaborationroom.org\, 812.334.8103\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T052141Z
LOCATION:The Collaboration Room
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Modern Portraits/Ancient Methods: An Egg Tempera Painting Workshop
TRANSP:OPAQUE
