DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, November 27th @ 7pm\n\nJ. Travis Grundon reading\n\n
 J. Travis Grundon has served as an editor and contributor on Forrest J Acke
 rman's Anthology of the Living Dead. His book Eclectic Collection is a feas
 t of fiction\, that illustrates his love\, and craft of short stories.\n\nH
 is other work can found in the Silven Trumpeter\, the Tecumseh Review\, Sca
 rs\, Paracinema\, Twisted Dreams and The Monsters Next Door magazine. Other
  works include stories for Help - An Anthology To Benefit Preditors and Edi
 tors\, Concrete Blood: Dark Tales of the City\, and Toe Tags 2.\n\n"J. Trav
 is Grundon is a visionary. You better watch out!" - Nicholas Grabowsky\, Re
 d Wet Dirt/ Black Bed Sheet Books\n\n"J. Travis Grundon 's stories are as f
 amiliar as sitting down to afternoon tea\, but his ideas are as exotic and 
 intoxicating as a good stiff shot added to the mix." - B.C. Brown\n\nhttp:/
 /jtravisgrundon.blogspot.com/\n\n \n\nhttp://www.facebook.com/event.php?eid
 =150517968324092
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T052021Z
LOCATION:Boxcar Books & Community Center Inc\, 408 e 6th st
