DESCRIPTION:Upland RadFest will feature Indiana craft brewers\, live music\
 , and rad fun. Half the proceeds will go to the Brewers of Indiana Guild wh
 ich promotes local craft beers across the state of Indiana.\n\nBands:\nSob 
 Sister\nThe Cocaine Wolves\nSlam Dunk!\nMustache\nDevil to Pay\nMedusa\nBul
 letwolf\n\nBreweries confirmed so far:\nAlcatraz Brewing Co.\nBarley Island
  Brewing Co.\nBloomington Brewing Co.\nBrugge Brasserie\nMad Anthony Brewin
 g Co.\nShorline Brewing Co.\nSun King Brewing Co.\nUpland Brewing Co.\n\nTi
 ckets will be available at Upland and other locations by May 15th. Tickets 
 are $20 in advance or $25 dollars at the door. Anyone dressed RAD at the ev
 ent will receive a free meal ticket. Rad is whatever you make of it (we thi
 nk ninjas\, robots and mohawks are pretty rad). Most raddest outfit will wi
 n an Upland T-shirt of choice and a $50 gift card to the Upland Tap Room.\n
 \nAdmission includes samples of fine Indiana craft beers\, bread and pretze
 ls\, and live outdoor rocking music. Hamburgers and brats with a side will 
 be available for purchase.\n\nCome one\, come all and have a rad good time!
