DESCRIPTION:\n924 West Sixth\n<br><br>\nThe equinox plays with the balances
  of opposing forces\; love vs. hate\, lack vs. abundance\, attraction vs. r
 epulsion\, crazy vs. sane. The autumnal equinox is also the time of the yea
 r when night conquers day.\n<br><br>\nThe SEQUINOX celebrates that conquest
  on behalf of the people of the night: the party people\, the freaks and we
 irdos\, the fabulously foxy\, the dancing machines\, the p.y.t.'s\, the per
 vs\, the lovers\, the boozers\, the genderfuckers\, the artists\, and every
 one inbetween.\n<Br><Br>\nDress sexy. Dance. Drink. Celebrate. 
