DESCRIPTION:525 E 9th Street \n<br><br>\nThe Wallpaper: An Investigation of
  an Infestation is an\ninstallation experiment created by Megan Abajian. Th
 e\nWallpaper seeks to explore how wallpaper acts as decoration\, barrier\, 
 and surface within an interior. This installation asks the question– what i
 f the walls were alive? Megan uses large-scale watercolors to alter the env
 ironment allowing the audience to explore what is behind\, on\, and off the
  walls.
