CREATED:20091209T215036Z
DESCRIPTION:HERE IT IS FOLKS!\n\nA sweaty and dirty holiday (whatever holid
 ay you may celebrate) dance party to end your Fall Semester at IU and one l
 ast rager for you to attend before you head home for a few weeks!\n\nThis i
 s going to be the place to be Thursday night before break!\n\nOutside of 3 
 amazing DJs\, there will also be an Ugliest Holiday Sweater contest in whic
 h you can win great prizes along with all the drinks and all the dancing yo
 u can handle!\n\nYour Bodacious entertainment for the night includes:\n\nDJ
  INDIANA JONES\n(Indianapolis\, Indiana)\n\nDJ Indiana Jones\, he has spun 
 alongside Mark Ronson\, A Trak\, Cosmo Baker\, Richie Hawtin\, Grandmaster 
 Flash\, Mick Boogie\, The Rub and has opened for acts ranging from Run D.M.
 C. and Sean Paul to Sting and Destiny's Child. DJ Indiana Jones has been vo
 ted "Best Club DJ" by the Readers of Indianapolis' Nuvo Newsweekly in 2002 
 and 2008 and with a client list including LRG\, Scion\, Man Alive\, Finish 
 Line\, Rich Kleiman\, Peyton Manning\, and Jermaine O'Neal among others\, D
 J Indiana Jones is a sure shot. Currently supporting residencies in New Yor
 k\, Orlando and Indianapolis his demand is diverse and far reaching!\n\nPHE
 NOM\n(Bloomington\, Indiana)\n\nIn just over a year\, DJ PHENOM has quickly
  taken the Midwest by storm. Playing a prominent role in establishing the d
 ance/electronic music scene in Bloomington\, IN\, his monthly sweaty and se
 xy SNEAK ATTACK parties provided misplaced music feigns a dance floor desti
 nation for the first time. He's rocked crowds nationwide from Indianapolis 
 to Louisville\, Baltimore to Chicago.\n\nCombining the low key vibe of a ho
 use party with the energy of a mega club\, PHENOM starts and keeps the part
 ying going. His blends of house\, electro\, bassline\, fidget and B-More ke
 ep the dance floor packed and are guaranteed to make any body move.\n\nWALL
 Y WONDER\n(Bloomington\, Indiana)\n\nAn avid fan of quality hip hop\, DJ Wa
 lly Wonder has been a huge tastemaker in Bloomington performing alongside A
 MAZING acts to grace the Bluebird stage including the likes of RAKIM\, Immo
 rtal Technique\, and various others. Wally is also a member of Tree City Al
 l-Stars and has been known to throw down sheer excellence with his party No
  MTV Raps.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T051927Z
LOCATION:The Bluebird
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Festivus Dance Party
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
