DESCRIPTION:Come watch a FREE screening of the film "Spend an Evening With 
 Saddle Creek".\n\nThe film walks viewers through the history of Saddle Cree
 k\, an independent record label nestled into Omaha\, Nebraska\, a city that
  is rich with talented musicians. This movie is the story of the record lab
 el as told by the people who made it happen.\n\nIncluded in the film is liv
 e footage\, archival photographs\, interviews\, and profiles of 15 acts\, 1
 1 of which are are still associated with the label. Bands that are featured
  include Bright Eyes\, The Faint\, and Cursive.\n\nExtras include interview
 s and early performances from Norman Bailer (the Faint’s original incarnati
 on)\, Commander Venus (featuring Conor Oberst)\, and local legends Slowdown
  Virginia (featuring Cursive’s Tim Kasher.\n\nTake a break from homework an
 d school\, and come join WIUX as we learn more about this amazing record la
 bel!
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T051922Z
LOCATION:Woodburn Hall 003 
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Film: "Spend an Evening With Saddle Creek"
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
