DESCRIPTION:BCT Presents<br><br>\nFASHION+FUNCTION+ART<br>\nThe Buskirk-Chu
 mley’s Annual Fundraiser\n8:00pm\n$15 General Admission\,$10 for students\n
 <br><br>\nBUY TICKETS: http://www.bloomingtonarts.info/Public/Calendar/perf
 ormance.asp?PerfID=22076\n<Br><BR>\nThe Buskirk-Chumley Theater will host i
 ts third annual fashion show\, Fashion+Function+Art\, Thursday\, October 23
 rd at 8:00pm. Sponsored by Optiks\, this fundraiser for Bloomington’s Commu
 nity Theater features fashion and food from Bloomington retailers. Doors op
 en for a cocktail hour at 7pm\, with the show beginning at 8. Local ‘celebr
 ities’ will strut their stuff down the runway while DJ Mothertrucker spins 
 the catalogue of local label Secretly Canadian. This year’s theme is Taking
  Risks\, so the fashions showcased are sure to be show-stoppers. Take your 
 own risk and wear your very chicest clothing to celebrate the city’s vibran
 t downtown life\, and the theater that enjoys a prime location at the heart
  of it!\n<BR><BR>\nFeatured retailers and restaurants in this year’s show i
 nclude: Briar and Burley\, B Boutique\, Bella Donna\, Bloomington Brewing C
 ompany\, Cactus Flower\, Haley’s\, Inseam Denim\, London Dog\, Malibu Grill
 \, Material Plane\, Natural Elements\, Nick’s English Hut\, O’Child Childre
 n’s Boutique\, Pizza Express\, Relish\, Rise\, Sole Sensations\, Superior S
 hoes\, Upland Brewery\, and Yarns Unlimited. The event is all ages\, and th
 ere will be a cash bar. Tickets are $15 general admission and $10 for stude
 nts and may be purchased at the Sunrise Box Office or online at www.bloomin
 gtonarts.info. For more information\, call the Sunrise Box Office at 812.32
 3.3020.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230221T052039Z
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Fashion+Function+Art
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
