CREATED:20250622T160726Z
DESCRIPTION:"An outrageous lesbian pop musical satire inspired by the pop f
 renzy of the early 2000s\, QUEENS OF DRAMA charts the rise and fall of new 
 star Mimi Madamour and her passionate\, rage-fueled love affair with punk i
 con Billie Kohler. Over the course of half a century we follow these drama 
 queens as they top the charts and set sail on the course of mad queer love.
  Featuring an iconic cast\, including Asia Argento and Alma Jodorowsky\, an
 d containing hit songs like 'Don’t Touch' by Yelle and 'Fisted to the Heart
 '\, this film vividly dissects the turbulence of toxic relationships—whethe
 r between fans and their idols or within passionate queer love affairs. Dir
 ector Alexis Langlois brings their trademark glittercore pop-punk aesthetic
  to create a vibrant\, unforgettable spectacle of music and passion."<br><a
  href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BXorUkBdM0M">Trailer<br><br></a><br>
 8:pm 21+ $8<br><a href="https://cicadacinema.com/products/queens-of-drama-j
