 ther a low-stakes\, low-pressure comedy show\, and NOW IT'S FINALLY HAPPENI
 NG!!\n\nCOMEDIANS:\n\nNatalie Bainter\nChris Clements\nDoug Dreary\nLars Ni
 chols\nJames Payne\nJonas Schrodt\nAndrew Wang\n\nHOSTED by:\nBethy Squires
 \n\nSets will be 5-10 minutes each (5 for the newbies\, 10 if the more seas
 oned among us want it)\, and the show will start PROMPTLY at 8. UEL ZING is
  a small space\, so 1) let's fill it with people\, and 2) I'd plan to arriv
 e by 7:30 to get a comfortable seat. We don't want to conflict with the Lip
  Sync Battle at The Back Door\, which gives us yet another reason to start 
 on time.\n\nI'M REALLY EXCITED FOR THIS! IF ANYONE WANTS TO TRY STAND-UP\, 
 OR HAS DONE IT AND WANTS TO TRY AGAIN\, MESSAGE ME (chris) BY THE END OF TH
 IS WEEK AND I CAN PROBABLY THROW YOU ON THE BILL!\n\nUel Zing Coffee\n725 W
