DESCRIPTION:"Sycamore Land Trust\, a nonprofit conservation organization pr
 otecting over 11\,800 acres in southern Indiana\, is thrilled to announce t
 heir fifth annual Spring Plant Sale! They are offering over 45 species of p
 lants that were homegrown in their Native Plant Nursery from seed to plant 
 plug. Many species are grown from locally collected seed at nearby preserve
 s. All species are ethically sourced and native to southern Indiana\, provi
 ding benefits to local pollinators and wildlife. Plants sell for $4 each\, 
 with all proceeds going back into nursery operations and native plant resto
 ration projects. Stop by to learn from experienced staff and volunteers on 
 the advantages of gardening with native species!"\n\n9am-2pm
LAST-MODIFIED:20260413T150946Z
LOCATION:Bloomingfoods Co-op Market\, 3220 E 3rd St\, Bloomington\, IN 4740
