UID:42r92hcshjpr4edqj7g1m3qd8l@google.com
CREATED:20241005T135107Z
DESCRIPTION:<b>Erica Dawn Lyle</b><i> (NYC)</i><br> Writer\, curator\, expe
 rimental musician\, and cultural instigator. The former touring guitar play
 er for Bikini Kill\, as a solo performer\, Lyle has released musical collab
 orations with Kim Gordon\, The Raincoats\,Onion Flavored Rings\, Black Rain
 bow\, Bernadette Mayer\, Kathleen Hanna\, Brontez Purcell\, and many more. 
 Lyle is the author of Streetopia(Booklyn\, 2015) and On The Lower Frequenci
 es: A Secret History of The City (Soft Skull\, 2008) and has written for Ar
