 de Island and directed by world-renowned photographer Bert Stern\, <em>Jazz
  on a Summer's Day</em> features intimate performances by an all-star line-
 up of musical legends including Louis Armstrong\, Thelonious Monk\, Gerry M
 ulligan\, Anita O'Day\, Chuck Berry\, Dinah Washington\, and closes with a 
 beautiful rendition of <em>The Lord's Prayer</em> by Mahalia Jackson at mid
 night to usher in Sunday morning."<br> <br>9:pm (dusk) Free! All Ages! <br>
 <a href="https://cicadacinema.com/products/jazz-on-a-summers-day-july-8-low
 er-cascades-park-dusk-9pm">Event Page</a>
