DESCRIPTION:Cicada Cinema presents: Thieves Highway (1949) screening.<br> <
 br>7pm $8 All Ages <br><a href="https://cicadacinema.com/products/thieves-h
 ighway-november-18-upland-wood-shop-7pm">Event page</a><br> <i> </i><br><i>
 Thieves’ Highway</i> vividly depicts the perilous world of “long-haul boys\
 ,” who drive by night to bring their goods to the markets of America’s citi
 es. Richard Conte stars as ex-G.I. Nick Garcos\, a tyro trucker bent on sat
 isfaction from the man responsible for crippling his father—ruthless market
  operator Mike Figlia (Lee J. Cobb). But when Figlia gets wise to his plan\
 , Nick finds himself in a web of treachery and heartbreak. Cicada Cinema is
  proud to present this searing noir from master Jules Dassin.
