CREATED:20240818T144218Z
DESCRIPTION:Run\, walk or roll. An anti--competitive 5k to raise money for 
 prisoners. <br> <br>Every year comrades (imprisoned and otherwise) run\, wa
 lk or roll 5kilometers on the same day to create connections beyond the pri
 son wallsand raise money for those locked up inside.It’s a noncompetitive e
 vent\, and everyone is encouraged to participateaccording to their physical
  preferences.We’re asking a minimum of $20-$40 donation for our war fund\, 
 so that wecan continue to send money to Michael Kimble\, Jennifer Gann\, Se
 an Swain\,and Marius Mason monthly stipends. You’ll get a great t-shirt for
 signing up\, commemorating the event\, and snacks will be provided! If youc
 hoose to pay digitally in advance\, we’ll follow up with paymentoptions.Bri
 ng a water bottle and wear clothes you feel comfortable moving in.<i>Regist
 ration closes August 27th!</i> <a target="_blank" href="https://bloomington
 abc.noblogs.org/rdtw24/">bloomingtonabc.noblogs.org/rdtw24/</a> <br><br><br
 >Register through August at:<br><a href="http://bloomingtonabc.noblogs.org"
  target="_blank">bloomingtonabc.noblogs.org</a><br><br>1:pm All Ages!
LAST-MODIFIED:20240825T165231Z
LOCATION:Bryan Park
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Running Down the Walls 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
