  senior from South Carolina\, gets her first glimpse of the wider world on 
 a class trip to Washington\, D.C. Separated from her schoolmates\, she emba
 rks on a fractured road trip in search of America. Along the way\, she fall
 s in with a variety of strange factions\, each living out their own alterna
 tive realities in our present day."<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/wat
 ch?v=uh9H30cobyE">Trailer</a><br><br>7:pm $8 No age limit but not for kids!
