 x Salon was created to foster campus-community conversations about sexualit
 y topics. Come\, grab a drink\, and enjoy. Our format goes like this: for t
 he first 30-40 minutes\, Debby will ask Maree questions about her work in t
 he area of teaching about pornography as well as creating educational progr
 ams for parents\, schools\, and communities. The next 20-30 minutes are Q&a
