DESCRIPTION:<b>Secret Mall Apartment </b><br> <br>"In 2003\, eight young Rh
 ode Islanders created a secret apartment in a hidden space inside the Provi
 dence Place Mall and lived in it for four years\, filming everything along 
 the way. They snuck in furniture\, tapped into the mall’s electricity\, and
  even secretly constructed a brick wall with a locking door\, smuggling in 
 over 2 tons of cinderblock. Far more than just a wild prank\, the secret ap
 artment became a deeply meaningful place for all its inhabitants – a person
 al expression of defiance against local gentrification\, a boundary-pushing
  work of public/private art\, and finally\, a 750 square foot space away fr
 om prying eyes"<br><a href="goog_1595006876"> </a><br><a href="https://www.
 youtube.com/watch?v=B9OCYOD-e9s&amp\;ab_channel=SecretMallApartment">Traile
 r </a><br> <br>6:pm $8 All Ages<br><a href="https://cicadacinema.com/produc
 ts/secret-mall-apartment-july-13-far-center">Event Page </a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250713T154435Z
LOCATION:FAR Center for Contemporary Arts\, 202 S Rogers St\, Bloomington\,
  IN 47404
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Cicada Cinema: Secret Mall Apartment (2024) 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
