  reasonable amount of stuff but not more than that. If you have extra-speci
 al used stuff\, consider pricing and donating it to the low-cost table\; be
 nefits from this table will be given to the Bloomington winter shelter and 
 to Palestine aid efforts. \n\nThe swap is open from noon to four pm\; come 
 early so people have time to find your great discards\, and if you have han
 gers and friends\, bring them\, too!"\n \n12:pm - 4:pm
