DESCRIPTION:Roughhousing for revolution (with less-rough activities for all
  our chill rad homies)\n\n"As we come out of the phase of high adrenaline a
 nd intense activation of the encampments\, we want to convene to sustain ou
 r energy and grow our stamina for a renewal of action in the fall. Join us 
 for games like tail tag\, capture the flag\, and other games designed to gr
 ow our capacities for participating in actions for social movements. Lead b
 y organizers involved in the movement for Palestinian liberation\, we hope 
