 e riders meander across Bloomington\, celebrating the many orgs and clubs t
 hat make this city great.\n\nOr skip the rush and come cheer a friend at th
 e finish line\, where those same groups will be tabling at the after party.
 \n\nAll donations go towards establishing community-owned land trust at Sem
 inary Pointe\, 29 units of affordable housing and community arts space in d
 owntwon Bloomington\n\nSave the Block Fundraiser.\n\nMeet at 5:pm at Bryan 
 Park Restrooms.\nStarting Gun at 5:30pm\n\nFinish Line at Friendly Beasts.\
 n\n$15 suggested donation for racers
