CREATED:20240512T154049Z
DESCRIPTION:"The four-film Female Prisoner Scorpion cycle charts the vengea
 nce of Nami Matsushima (Meiko Kaji\, LADY SNOWBLOOD)\, who becomes an avata
 r of survival and an unlikely symbol of female resistance in a male-dominat
 ed world. Spiritually akin to MS. 45\, COFFY\, and THE BRIDE WORE BLACK\, F
 EMALE PRISONER SCORPION: #701 (the first film in the cycle) introduces Nami
  — a gullible\, unjustly imprisoned woman who must find a way to escape and
  exact revenge upon the man who betrayed her. Featuring stunning pop-art co
 mpositions and ultra-violent outbursts\, it’s easy to see why this movie wa
 s a direct inspiration for Uma Thurman’s character of “The Bride” in Quenti
 n Tarantino’s KILL BILL."<br><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SuMwN
 gJL2a4&rco=1" target="_blank">Trailer<br><br></a><br>7:pm Free but ticketed
  (seating is limited) 18+<a href="https://cicadacinema.com/products/female-
 prisoner-710-scorpion-may-23-orbit-room-7pm">Event Page</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20240512T155903Z
