DESCRIPTION:"Marigold aims to highlight femininity in Jazz – especially my 
 own experiences as a female jazz trombonist – and my compositions combine a
  variety of influences from modern jazz to my first musical inspirations li
 ke Etta James\, J.J. Johnson\, and Earth Wind\, &amp\; Fire. My most recent
  research (submitted for publication) on gender discrimination in jazz heav
 ily influenced the desire to record my music\, as I discovered how few wome
 n were/are able to overcome the implicit biases of jazz culture\, oftentime
 s lacking opportunities to record their music."<br><br><br><br>            
 <br>8:30pm 21+ $10<br><a href="http://www.thebishopbar.com/events/leah-warm
 an-album-release">Event page </a>
