DESCRIPTION:"<span dir="auto">This co-working session is designed for anyon
 e looking to build or refine their privacy\, security\, and digital media l
 iteracy and skills. While it’s geared towards beginners\, people with more 
 advanced knowledge are also welcome to join. If there are tasks or updates 
 you’ve been putting off\, whether it’s tightening your security or enhancin
 g your privacy\, this is the right event for you! We’ll provide resources\,
  worksheets\, and in-person support to help you identify the most relevant 
 actions for your needs and guide you through them.Come anytime between 5-8p
 m at the Downtown Library in room 1B. If there is enough interest we will a
 lso have an online call for people to drop in to if they cannot come in per
 son. Food will be provided!  BYOD: bring your own (computer or phone) devic
 e!"<br><br></span><br><span dir="auto">Room 1-B<br><br></span><br><span dir
 ="auto">5:pm - 8:30<br></span>
